window.PRD_HTML = "<header class=\"prd-head\">\n  <a href=\"#\" title=\"Home\"><img src=\"assets/img/shriram-logo.png\" alt=\"Shriram Credit\"></a>\n  <div><h1>SCCL LAMF \u2013 LOS Product Requirements Document (PRD)</h1>\n  <p>Customer Online Journey &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; Last updated: 13-10-2026 06:37</p></div>\n  <a class=\"prd-link\" href=\"#SCREENS\">All screens \u2192</a>\n</header>\n<main class=\"prd-body\">\n<p class=\"note\">This document is generated from the confirmed discussion log. Status:\n<span class=\"tag yts\">YTS</span> yet to start \u00b7\n<span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span> in progress \u2013 not final \u00b7\n<span class=\"tag ok\">Completed</span> confirmed as done by the product owner.</p>\n<h2>Module 1 \u2013 Mobile Number Verification</h2>\n<p class=\"screens\">Screen 01) LAMF Landing Page \u00b7 Screen 02) Enter MF linked Mobile Number</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th style=\"width:52px\">SL.No</th><th style=\"width:330px\">Screenshot</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Functionality</th><th>Description</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Data Points Required</th><th style=\"width:165px\">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr id=\"sl-1\"><td class=\"sl\">1</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-01.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td>User clicking the \u201cCheck your eligibility in 2 minutes\u201d CTA or the \u201cStart Your Application\u201d CTA in landing page to start the journey</td><td><p>The customer shall access the SCCL LAMF journey through the LAMF URL (https://uatlamf.shriramcredit.in/). On successful access, the system shall load and display the SCCL LAMF Landing Page, which serves as the entry point for initiating the LAMF application journey.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Check your eligibility in 2 minutes</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTA (Button)</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the system shall open the \u201cEnter your MF linked Mobile Number\u201d pop up over the landing page, which is the first step of the LAMF journey.</p></div><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Start Your Application</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTA (Button)</p><p><b>Action:</b> Placed below the 8-step \u201cHow to Apply\u201d section. On click, the system shall perform the same action as the \u201cCheck your eligibility in 2 minutes\u201d CTA and open the mobile number pop up.</p></div></td><td class=\"dp\"><b>Clicked CTA:</b><ul><li>Check your eligibility in 2 minutes</li><li>Start Your Application</li></ul><br><b>Clicked Timestamp:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td><span class=\"tag ok\">Completed</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-2\"><td rowspan=\"7\" class=\"sl\">2</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-02.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"7\">User entering the MF linked Mobile Number for the mobile number verification</td><td><p>The system shall display the \u201cEnter your MF linked Mobile Number\u201d pop up over the landing page. While the pop up is open the background page shall remain frozen and shall not scroll; the pop up itself shall scroll only when its content does not fit the screen (for example when the customer has zoomed in).</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Pop up title:</b> \u201cEnter your MF linked Mobile Number\u201d</li><li><b>Close icon:</b> (X) at the top right</li><li><b>Mobile Number field placeholder:</b> \u201c9876543210\u201d</li><li><b>Consent checkbox text:</b> \u201cBy proceeding, I agree to T&amp;C and Privacy Policy of Shriram Credit.\u201d \u2013 T&amp;C and Privacy Policy are hyperlinks</li><li><b>CTA:</b> \u201cContinue\u201d \u2013 grey until the checkbox is ticked, then yellow</li><li><b>Validation messages:</b> <ul><li>\u201c*Required\u201d <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-01\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-01');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-01\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-01</a></li><li>\u201c*Invalid mobile number\u201d <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-02\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-02');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-02\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-02</a></li><li>\u201cError: Invalid phone number\u201d <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-03\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-03');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-03\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-03</a></li><li>No message for a non numeric character <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-04\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-04');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-04\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-04</a></li></ul></li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"7\" class=\"dp\"><b>Mobile Number:</b> 9597001623<br><br><b>Consent Accepted:</b><ul><li>Yes</li><li>No</li></ul><br><b>Submitted Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td rowspan=\"7\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Completed</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f02-close.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> (X) Close Icon</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Icon</p><p><b>Action:</b> After clicking this, navigate user to landing page by closing this pop up</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f02-field.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Mobile Number</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Text Field</p><p><b>Minimum Character:</b> 10 Char</p><p><b>Maximum Character:</b> 10 Char</p><p><b>Value Type:</b> User inputs</p><p><b>Input Value format:</b> Numeric only</p><p><b>Action:</b> User has to enter the MF linked mobile number.</p><p><b>Condition:</b> Only numbers can be entered. Alphabets, spaces and special characters cannot be entered, and no message is shown. <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-04\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-04');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-04\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-04</a></p><p><b>Validation:</b> <ul><li>\u201c*Required\u201d \u2013 displayed when user clicks Continue CTA without entering the mobile number <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-01\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-01');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-01\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-01</a></li><li>\u201c*Invalid mobile number\u201d \u2013 displayed when user clicks Continue CTA with less than 10 digits, and on exit from the field <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-02\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-02');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-02\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-02</a></li><li>\u201cError: Invalid phone number\u201d \u2013 displayed when the mobile number starts with 0 to 5 and the user clicks Continue CTA <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-03\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-03');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-03\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-03</a></li></ul></p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f02-consent.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Before \u2013 unticked (default)</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f02-consent-ticked.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>After \u2013 ticked</figcaption></figure></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> (Checkbox)</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Check box</p><p><b>Action:</b> User has to click the Checkbox. Once this checkbox is clicked then only the Continue CTA has to be enabled</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f02-tnc.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> T&amp;C</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Hyperlink</p><p><b>Action:</b> User has to click this hyperlink to view the Terms and Conditions. On click, the system shall redirect the user to https://www.shriramcredit.in/terms-and-conditions (opens in a new tab, so the details entered on this screen are kept).</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f02-privacy.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Privacy Policy</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Hyperlink</p><p><b>Action:</b> User has to click this hyperlink to view the Privacy Policy. On click, the system shall redirect the user to https://www.shriramcredit.in/privacy-policy (opens in a new tab, so the details entered on this screen are kept).</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f02-cta.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Before \u2013 disabled (grey) until the checkbox is ticked</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f02-cta-enabled.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>After \u2013 enabled once the checkbox is ticked</figcaption></figure></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Continue</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTA (Button)</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the system shall validate all conditions of this screen. If every condition is met, the system shall trigger the OTP to the entered mobile number and navigate the customer to the OTP verification screen. If any condition fails, the customer shall not be allowed to proceed and the respective validation shall be displayed.</p><p><b>Condition:</b> CTA is disabled (grey) and cannot be clicked until the consent checkbox is ticked, so no validation is shown for the checkbox. Once enabled, validation order: mobile number entered \u2192 first digit 6 to 9 \u2192 10 digits.</p></div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>Module 2 \u2013 OTP Verification (MF linked Mobile Number)</h2>\n<p class=\"screens\">Screen 03) Enter OTP for MF linked Mobile Number Verification</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th style=\"width:52px\">SL.No</th><th style=\"width:330px\">Screenshot</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Functionality</th><th>Description</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Data Points Required</th><th style=\"width:165px\">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr id=\"sl-3\"><td rowspan=\"8\" class=\"sl\">3</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-03.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"8\">User entering the OTP received on the MF linked mobile number to complete the mobile number verification</td><td><p>On successful submission of the mobile number, the system shall send a 6 digit OTP to the MF linked mobile number and display the \u201cEnter OTP\u201d pop up over the landing page. The mobile number shall be displayed in masked format (+91, first 2 digits, XXXX, last 4 digits).</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Pop up title:</b> \u201cEnter OTP\u201d</li><li><b>Close icon:</b> (X) at the top right</li><li><b>Sent message:</b> \u201cA 6-digit OTP has been sent by Shriram Credit to\u201d followed by the masked mobile number and the \u201cEdit\u201d link</li><li><b>OTP boxes:</b> 6 single digit boxes</li><li><b>Resend line:</b> \u201cDidn\u2019t Receive OTP?\u201d with the countdown timer (0:30 to 0:01), then the \u201cResend OTP\u201d link</li><li><b>Experian consent checkbox text (first OTP verification only):</b> \u201cI hereby consent to appoint Shriram Credit as my authorised representative to receive my credit information from Experian for the purpose of providing/ evaluating loan offers.\u201d</li><li><b>CTA:</b> \u201cSubmit OTP\u201d \u2013 grey until all 6 digits are entered and the consent is ticked (when the checkbox is displayed), then yellow</li><li><b>Validation messages:</b> <ul><li>\u201cInvalid OTP\u201d <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-06\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-06');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-06\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-06</a></li><li>\u201cMaximum OTP retry limit reached. Please retry again after N minute(s).\u201d \u2013 N is the time left in the 60 minute block</li><li>\u201cError: Maximum OTP resend limit reached. Please retry again after N minute(s).\u201d \u2013 N is the time left in the 15 minute block</li><li>\u201cInvalid request id\u201d \u2013 OTP submitted after 30 seconds <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-09\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-09');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-09\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-09</a></li><li>No message for a non numeric character <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-05\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-05');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-05\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-05</a></li></ul></li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"8\" class=\"dp\"><b>OTP Entered:</b> 6 digit numeric<br><br><b>OTP Verified:</b><ul><li>Yes</li><li>No</li></ul><br><b>OTP Verified Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS<br><br><b>Resend Count:</b> 0\u20133<br><br><b>Wrong Attempt Count:</b> 0\u20133<br><br><b>Blocked Start Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS<br><br><b>Blocked End Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS<br><br><b>Experian Consent:</b><ul><li>Yes</li><li>No</li></ul></td><td rowspan=\"8\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Completed</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f03-close.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> (X) Close Icon</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Icon</p><p><b>Action:</b> After clicking this, close the pop up and navigate the user to the landing page</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f03-sent.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Masked Mobile Number</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Display text</p><p><b>Prefilled Value:</b> Mobile number entered on the previous screen, masked as +91 + first 2 digits + XXXX + last 4 digits</p><p><b>Action:</b> Display only, not editable</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f03-edit.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Edit</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Icon with hyperlink</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, navigate the user to the previous screen (Enter your MF linked Mobile Number). The mobile number entered by the user shall be prefilled in the field.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f03-otp.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Enter OTP</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> 6 single character boxes</p><p><b>Minimum Character:</b> 6 Char</p><p><b>Maximum Character:</b> 6 Char</p><p><b>Value Type:</b> User inputs</p><p><b>Input Value format:</b> Numeric only</p><p><b>Action:</b> User has to enter the 6 digit OTP received on the MF linked mobile number.</p><p><b>Condition:</b> Only numbers can be entered, up to 6 digits. Alphabets, spaces and special characters cannot be entered, and no message is shown. <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-05\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-05');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-05\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-05</a></p><p><b>Validation:</b> <ul><li>\u201cInvalid OTP\u201d \u2013 displayed on each wrong OTP, for the 1st, 2nd and 3rd back to back wrong attempt. Wrong attempts are counted only while the pop up stays open: if the customer closes the pop up and then enters a wrong OTP again, it is counted as the 1st attempt <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-06\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-06');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-06\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-06</a></li><li>\u201cMaximum OTP retry limit reached. Please retry again after N minute(s).\u201d \u2013 after 3 back to back wrong OTP attempts in the same pop up the customer is blocked for 60 minutes; displayed on the next attempt. N is the time left in the 60 minute block (e.g. a customer returning after 10 minutes sees 50)</li><li>\u201cInvalid request id\u201d \u2013 displayed when the customer submits the OTP more than 30 seconds after it was sent (the OTP is valid for 30 seconds) <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-09\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-09');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-09\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-09</a></li></ul></p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f03-resend.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Before \u2013 timer running, Resend OTP disabled</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f03-resend-enabled.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>After \u2013 timer ends, Resend OTP enabled</figcaption></figure></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Resend OTP</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Timer with hyperlink CTA</p><p><b>Action:</b> The timer shall start at 0:30 and run down to 0:01. At 0 the Resend OTP CTA shall be enabled. On click, the OTP shall be sent again and the timer shall restart.</p><p><b>Condition:</b> The customer can click Resend OTP 3 times back to back (1st, 2nd and 3rd) in the same pop up. On the next click the customer is blocked from resending for 15 minutes.</p><p><b>Validation:</b> \u201cError: Maximum OTP resend limit reached. Please retry again after N minute(s).\u201d \u2013 displayed when the customer clicks Resend OTP after the 3rd back to back resend. N is the time left in the 15 minute block (e.g. a customer returning after 10 minutes sees 5)</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f03-consent.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Before \u2013 unticked (default)</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f03-consent-ticked.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>After \u2013 ticked</figcaption></figure></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> (Checkbox) Experian consent</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Check box</p><p><b>Action:</b> User has to tick this checkbox to appoint Shriram Credit as the authorised representative to receive the credit information from Experian for the purpose of providing / evaluating loan offers.</p><p><b>Condition:</b> Displayed only when the customer verifies the OTP for the first time. For a customer who has already verified the OTP earlier, the checkbox is not displayed. When displayed, Submit OTP CTA shall be enabled only when this checkbox is ticked and all 6 OTP digits are entered, so no validation is shown for the checkbox.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f03-cta.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Before \u2013 disabled (grey) until all 6 digits are entered</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f03-cta-enabled.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>After \u2013 enabled once all 6 digits are entered</figcaption></figure></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Submit OTP</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTA (Button)</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the system shall validate the entered OTP. If the OTP is correct, the system shall trigger the Experian API with the mobile number to retrieve the credit score and navigate the customer to the PAN Verification screen. If the OTP is wrong, the customer shall not be allowed to proceed and the respective validation shall be displayed.</p><p><b>Condition:</b> CTA is disabled (grey) and cannot be clicked until all 6 OTP digits are entered and the Experian consent checkbox is ticked (for a customer who has already verified the OTP earlier, the checkbox is not displayed and only the 6 digits are needed), so no validation is shown for these. Once enabled, the wrong OTP and block validations are shown under the Enter OTP field.</p></div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>Module 3 \u2013 PAN Verification</h2>\n<p class=\"screens\">Screen 04) Enter PAN Details</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th style=\"width:52px\">SL.No</th><th style=\"width:330px\">Screenshot</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Functionality</th><th>Description</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Data Points Required</th><th style=\"width:165px\">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr id=\"sl-4\"><td rowspan=\"7\" class=\"sl\">4</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-04.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"7\">User entering the Name as per PAN, DOB and PAN Number to verify the PAN</td><td><p>On successful OTP verification the system shall navigate the customer to the PAN Details page. The mobile number verified in Sl. No 2 and 3 is carried forward and displayed as a non editable field. The Experian credit information call is triggered in the background; the customer is not made to wait for the response.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Header:</b> Shriram Credit logo (left) and the logout icon (right)</li><li><b>Page title:</b> \u201cPAN Details\u201d</li><li><b>Sub text:</b> \u201cPlease verify your PAN to get the best loan offers\u201d</li><li><b>Field labels:</b> \u201cMobile Number\u201d, \u201cName as per PAN\u201d, \u201cDOB\u201d, \u201cPAN Number\u201d</li><li><b>Placeholders:</b> DOB: \u201cDD/MM/YYYY\u201d; PAN Number: \u201cABCDE 1234 F\u201d</li><li><b>CTA:</b> \u201cContinue\u201d</li><li><b>Validation messages:</b> <ul><li>\u201c*Required\u201d \u2013 any field left empty <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-10\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-10');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-10\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-10</a></li><li>\u201c*Invalid date\u201d \u2013 DOB typed before 01-Jan-1920 or after today <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-12\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-12');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-12\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-12</a></li><li>PAN Number with fewer than 10 characters <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-16\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-16');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-16\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-16</a></li><li>PAN character that does not fit its position \u2013 \u201c1st character must be a letter\u201d \u2026 \u201c10th character must be a letter\u201d (one message per position) <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-11\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-11');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-11\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-11</a></li><li>\u201cPAN verification failed\u201d \u2013 name match below 60%, DOB not matching the PAN records, or PAN Number not available <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-13\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-13');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-13\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-13</a> <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-15\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-15');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-15\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-15</a> <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-17\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-17');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-17\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-17</a></li></ul></li></ul></div><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Drop off:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>When:</b> The customer leaves the journey on this page before the PAN verification is completed (e.g. closes the browser or tab, or logs out)</li><li><b>On return:</b> When the customer comes back and logs in again with the mobile number (Sl. No 2) and OTP (Sl. No 3), on OTP verification success the customer lands on this PAN Details page</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"7\" class=\"dp\"><b>Mobile Number:</b> 9597001623 (carried from Sl. No 2)<br><br><b>Name as per PAN:</b> up to 150 characters<br><br><b>DOB:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY<br><br><b>PAN Number:</b> ABCDE1234F<br><br><b>Submitted Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS<br><br><b>Experian API Triggered:</b><ul><li>Yes</li><li>No</li></ul><br><b>Experian Response:</b> <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-09\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-09');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-09\">Pending \u00b7 P-09</a></td><td rowspan=\"7\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Completed</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f04-logout.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Logout</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Icon (top navigation, right corner)</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the customer is logged out and lands on the Landing page (Sl. No 1), as it is the exit page.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f04-mobile.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Mobile Number</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Display field</p><p><b>Prefilled Value:</b> Mobile number verified in Sl. No 2 and 3</p><p><b>Action:</b> Display only, not editable</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f04-name.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Name as per PAN</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Text Field</p><p><b>Minimum Character:</b> 1 Char</p><p><b>Maximum Character:</b> 150 Char</p><p><b>Value Type:</b> User inputs</p><p><b>Input Value format:</b> Alphabets (A\u2013Z) and space only <a class=\"done-ref\" href=\"#CR-14\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-14');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-14\">Changed \u00b7 CR-14</a></p><p><b>Action:</b> User has to enter the name exactly as printed on the PAN card.</p><p><b>Condition:</b> Numbers and special characters cannot be entered. Whatever the user types is captured in CAPITAL letters (e.g. \u201cazhagar samy\u201d is captured as \u201cAZHAGAR SAMY\u201d). When an error is shown for this field, its border turns red.</p><p><b>Validation:</b> <ul><li>\u201c*Required\u201d \u2013 displayed when the user clicks Continue CTA without entering the name <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-10\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-10');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-10\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-10</a></li><li>Name match with the PAN records below 60% \u2013 \u201cPAN verification failed\u201d is displayed when the user clicks Continue CTA <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-13\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-13');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-13\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-13</a></li></ul></p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f04-dob.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Before \u2013 type the date, or click the calendar icon</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f04-dob-calendar.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>After \u2013 calendar opened from the icon (date selected)</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f04-dob-invalid.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Typed date outside 01-Jan-1920 to today \u2013 \u201c*Invalid date\u201d next to the DOB label</figcaption></figure></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> DOB</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Text Field with calendar icon</p><p><b>Minimum Character:</b> 10 Char</p><p><b>Maximum Character:</b> 10 Char</p><p><b>Value Type:</b> User inputs or selects</p><p><b>Input Value format:</b> Numeric, DD/MM/YYYY</p><p><b>Action:</b> User can type the date of birth, or click the calendar icon and select it from the calendar pop up.</p><p><b>Condition:</b> The calendar allows dates from 01-Jan-1920 up to today only; a date outside this range cannot be selected. Any date can be typed; a typed date before 01-Jan-1920 or after today (e.g. 05/01/1900, year 1010 or 9090) is not accepted and the field border turns red. The age limit (18 to 70 years) is not checked on this page \u2013 it is validated on the Curated Offers page, so customers outside the limit are not blocked here and can be tracked (how many come in beyond the limit). When an error is shown for this field, its border turns red.</p><p><b>Validation:</b> <ul><li>\u201c*Required\u201d \u2013 displayed when the user clicks Continue CTA without entering the DOB <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-10\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-10');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-10\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-10</a></li><li>\u201c*Invalid date\u201d \u2013 displayed next to the DOB label when the typed date is before 01-Jan-1920 or after today <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-12\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-12');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-12\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-12</a></li><li>DOB not matching the DOB fetched from the PAN records \u2013 \u201cPAN verification failed\u201d is displayed when the user clicks Continue CTA <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-15\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-15');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-15\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-15</a></li></ul></p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f04-pan.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Before \u2013 empty</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f04-pan-filled.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>After \u2013 PAN shown with spaces: ABCDE 1234 F</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f04-pan-error.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Error \u2013 field border turns red</figcaption></figure></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> PAN Number</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Text Field</p><p><b>Minimum Character:</b> 10 Char</p><p><b>Maximum Character:</b> 10 Char</p><p><b>Value Type:</b> User inputs</p><p><b>Input Value format:</b> ABCDE1234F \u2013 characters 1 to 5 letters, 6 to 9 numbers, 10th a letter. Any letter is accepted in the 4th place <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-18\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-18');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-18\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-18</a></p><p><b>Action:</b> User has to enter the 10 character PAN.</p><p><b>Condition:</b> The PAN is shown with spaces as ABCDE 1234 F (e.g. CBOPA 8195 B). A character that does not fit its position cannot be entered, and a message for that position is shown at once next to the PAN Number label:<ul><li>\u201c1st character must be a letter\u201d</li><li>\u201c2nd character must be a letter\u201d</li><li>\u201c3rd character must be a letter\u201d</li><li>\u201c4th character must be a letter\u201d</li><li>\u201c5th character must be a letter\u201d</li><li>\u201c6th character must be a number\u201d</li><li>\u201c7th character must be a number\u201d</li><li>\u201c8th character must be a number\u201d</li><li>\u201c9th character must be a letter\u201d</li><li>\u201c10th character must be a letter\u201d</li></ul>E.g. CBOPA8195B and CBOCA8195B can both be entered. <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-11\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-11');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-11\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-11</a> <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-18\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-18');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-18\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-18</a> When an error is shown for this field, its border turns red.</p><p><b>Validation:</b> <ul><li>\u201c*Required\u201d \u2013 displayed when the user clicks Continue CTA without entering the PAN Number <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-10\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-10');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-10\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-10</a></li><li>PAN Number with fewer than 10 characters \u2013 error displayed next to the PAN Number label when the user clicks Continue CTA <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-16\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-16');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-16\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-16</a></li><li>PAN Number not available in the PAN records \u2013 \u201cPAN verification failed\u201d is displayed when the user clicks Continue CTA <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-17\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-17');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-17\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-17</a></li></ul></p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f04-cta.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Continue</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTA (Button)</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the system shall validate all the fields on this page and then verify the PAN details in this order, each check running only when the previous one passes:<ol><li>PAN Number \u2013 must be available in the PAN records (100% match);</li><li>DOB \u2013 must match the DOB fetched from the PAN records (100% match);</li><li>Name as per PAN \u2013 must match the name in the PAN records by 60% or more.</li></ol>The customer\u2019s age (18 to 70 years) is not checked here \u2013 see DOB. If everything passes, the customer is taken to the next page (LOS to MF Central consent). If any check fails, the customer is not allowed to proceed and \u201cPAN verification failed\u201d is displayed. <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-13\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-13');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-13\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-13</a> <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-15\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-15');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-15\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-15</a> <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-17\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-17');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-17\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-17</a></p><p><b>Condition:</b> Always enabled.</p></div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>Module 4 \u2013 Mutual Fund Portfolio Fetch (MF Central)</h2>\n<p class=\"screens\">Screen 05) LOS to MF Central Redirection consent page \u00b7 Screen 06) LOS to MF Central Redirection loading page \u00b7 Screen 07.1) PAN and Mobile Number Combination No Data Available</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th style=\"width:52px\">SL.No</th><th style=\"width:330px\">Screenshot</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Functionality</th><th>Description</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Data Points Required</th><th style=\"width:165px\">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr id=\"sl-5\"><td rowspan=\"4\" class=\"sl\">5</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-05.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"4\">User giving consent to fetch the mutual fund portfolio from MF Central and clicking the \u201cCheck Credit Limit\u201d CTA</td><td><p>On successful PAN verification (Sl. No 4) the system shall navigate the customer to the Credit Limit Against Mutual Fund page. The PAN Number verified in Sl. No 4 is carried forward and displayed as a non editable field. The customer gives consent to fetch the mutual fund portfolio from MF Central and clicks Check Credit Limit; the customer is then redirected to MF Central, where the portfolio for the entered PAN and mobile number is fetched to determine the eligible credit limit and the loan offers. The left side of the page shows the loan highlights and the \u201cHow it works\u201d steps (display only). The top navigation (Credit Score and Profile icons) is described in Sl. No 6.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Header:</b> Top navigation \u2013 Shriram Credit logo (left); Credit Score icon and Profile icon (right) \u2013 see Sl. No 6</li><li><b>Left panel:</b> \u201cInterest rates starting from 10.5% p.a.*\u201d; \u201cGet a Loan up to 75% of your eligible Mutual Fund portfolio\u201d; \u201cInterest-only EMI payments\u201d; \u201cDisbursal in 2 hours post application\u201d</li><li><b>How it works:</b> \u201cHow it works\u201d \u2013 \u201cApply for loan within mins.\u201d with 9 steps:<ol><li>Check your eligibility, credit limit, and interest rates.</li><li>Select mutual fund units to pledge.</li><li>Complete your KYC verification.</li><li>Pledge your selected mutual fund units.</li><li>Your loan amount is approved, Sanction Letter with Key Fact Statement (KFS) is issued.</li><li>e-Sign the loan agreement.</li><li>Your loan account is ready to use.</li><li>Withdraw funds as needed.</li><li>Repay the loan at your convenience and regain complete control of your mutual fund holdings.</li></ol></li><li><b>Card title:</b> \u201cCredit Limit Against Mutual Fund\u201d</li><li><b>Sub text:</b> \u201cMutual fund will be fetched from MF Central to determine the eligible credit limit and best loan offers\u201d</li><li><b>Field label:</b> \u201cPAN Number\u201d</li><li><b>Consent checkbox text:</b> \u201cI authorize Shriram Credit to fetch my mutual fund portfolio holdings from MF Central to assess my eligibility and credit limit for a Loan Against Mutual Funds.\u201d</li><li><b>CTA:</b> \u201cCheck Credit Limit\u201d \u2013 grey until the consent is ticked, then yellow</li><li><b>Validation messages:</b> None on this page \u2013 the CTA stays grey until the consent is ticked</li></ul></div><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Drop off:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>When:</b> The customer leaves the journey on this page before clicking Check Credit Limit (e.g. closes the browser or tab)</li><li><b>On return:</b> When the customer comes back and logs in again with the mobile number (Sl. No 2) and OTP (Sl. No 3), on OTP verification success the customer lands on this page, with the PAN Number prefilled</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"4\" class=\"dp\"><b>PAN Number:</b> ABCDE1234F (carried from Sl. No 4)<br><br><b>MF Central Consent:</b><ul><li>Yes</li><li>No</li></ul><br><b>Consent Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS<br><br><b>Check Credit Limit Clicked Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td rowspan=\"4\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Completed</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f05-pan.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> PAN Number</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Display field</p><p><b>Prefilled Value:</b> PAN Number verified in Sl. No 4, shown with spaces as ABCDE 1234 F</p><p><b>Action:</b> Display only, not editable</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f05-consent.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Before \u2013 unticked (default)</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f05-consent-ticked.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>After \u2013 ticked</figcaption></figure></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> (Checkbox) MF Central consent</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Check box</p><p><b>Action:</b> User has to tick this checkbox to authorize Shriram Credit to fetch the mutual fund portfolio holdings from MF Central to assess the eligibility and credit limit for a Loan Against Mutual Funds.</p><p><b>Condition:</b> Unticked by default. Check Credit Limit CTA is enabled only when this checkbox is ticked, so no validation is shown for the checkbox.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f05-cta.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Before \u2013 disabled (grey) until the consent is ticked</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f05-cta-enabled.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>After \u2013 enabled once the consent is ticked</figcaption></figure></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Check Credit Limit</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTA (Button)</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the system shall record the MF Central consent and open the MF Central redirection pop up (Sl. No 7); after the 5 second countdown the customer is redirected to MF Central to fetch the mutual fund portfolio for the entered PAN Number and mobile number.</p><p><b>Condition:</b> CTA is disabled (grey) and cannot be clicked until the consent checkbox is ticked, so no validation is shown.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-7\"><td rowspan=\"6\" class=\"sl\">7</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f07-redirect.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"6\">MF Central redirection pop up after clicking \u201cCheck Credit Limit\u201d \u2013 countdown, then redirect to MF Central</td><td><p>On clicking Check Credit Limit (Sl. No 5) the system shall open the MF Central redirection pop up over the page. The pop up counts down from 5 seconds to 1 second (\u201cRedirecting to MF Central in 5 seconds\u201d \u2026 \u201c1 seconds\u201d) while the progress bar fills; when the countdown ends, MF Central checks the PAN and mobile number combination: if data is available the customer is redirected to MF Central (Sl. No 8), otherwise the \u201cisn\u2019t linked to the PAN\u201d page is shown (Sl. No 7.1). If the customer clicks the close icon, a confirmation pop up asks whether to cancel the portfolio fetch.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Logo:</b> MF Central logo</li><li><b>Countdown:</b> \u201cRedirecting to MF Central in N seconds\u201d \u2013 N counts down 5, 4, 3, 2, 1; a yellow progress bar fills as it counts</li><li><b>Heading:</b> \u201cHere\u2019s what you need to do\u201d</li><li><b>Steps:</b> <ol><li>Enter the 6-digit OTP received from MF Central on your mobile number.</li><li>Select all the AMCs and continue</li></ol></li><li><b>Note:</b> \u201cNote You\u2019ll return to the process automatically after completing this step.\u201d</li><li><b>Close icon:</b> (X) at the top right</li><li><b>Cancel confirmation pop up:</b> \u201cAre you sure you want to cancel your mutual fund portfolio fetch?\u201d with \u201cNo, don\u2019t\u201d and \u201cYes, cancel\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"6\" class=\"dp\"><b>Redirection Pop up Shown Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS<br><br><b>Cancel Clicked:</b><ul><li>Yes, cancel</li><li>No, don\u2019t</li></ul><br><b>Cancel Clicked Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS<br><br><b>Redirected to MF Central Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td rowspan=\"6\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Completed</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f07-countdown.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Redirection countdown</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Timer with progress bar</p><p><b>Action:</b> Starts at 5 seconds and counts down to 1 second; when it ends the customer is redirected to the MF Central page automatically.</p><p><b>Condition:</b> The countdown stops while the cancel confirmation pop up is open.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"prd-assets/f07-close.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> (X) Close icon</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Icon</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the system shall open the cancel confirmation pop up.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f07-cancel.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Cancel confirmation pop up</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Pop up</p><p><b>Action:</b> Shows \u201cAre you sure you want to cancel your mutual fund portfolio fetch?\u201d with two CTAs: \u201cNo, don\u2019t\u201d and \u201cYes, cancel\u201d.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f07-no.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> No, don\u2019t</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTA (text button)</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the confirmation pop up closes and the redirection pop up continues, with the countdown starting again from 5 seconds.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f07-yes.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Yes, cancel</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTA (Button)</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, both pop ups close, the portfolio fetch is cancelled and the customer is back on the LOS to MF Central consent page (Sl. No 5).</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-7.1\"><td rowspan=\"4\" class=\"sl\">7.1</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-09.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"4\">PAN and mobile number not linked \u2013 MF Central has no data for the combination</td><td><p>After the redirection countdown (Sl. No 7), when MF Central has no data for the PAN and mobile number combination, the customer is not taken to MF Central; a separate page is shown saying the mobile number is not linked to the PAN entered.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Header:</b> Top navigation \u2013 see Sl. No 6</li><li><b>Illustration:</b> Three cards with question marks</li><li><b>Message:</b> \u201cThe identifier below isn\u2019t linked to the PAN you entered\u201d</li><li><b>Mobile number:</b> Phone icon with the masked mobile number (e.g. +919XXXX1623)</li><li><b>CTA:</b> \u201cRefresh\u201d with the refresh icon</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"4\" class=\"dp\"><b>Not Linked Page Shown Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS<br><br><b>Refresh Clicked:</b><ul><li>Yes</li><li>No</li></ul><br><b>Refresh Clicked Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td rowspan=\"4\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Completed</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f09-message.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Not linked message</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Display text</p><p><b>Action:</b> \u201cThe identifier below isn\u2019t linked to the PAN you entered\u201d \u2013 display only.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f09-mobile.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Mobile number</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Display field</p><p><b>Prefilled Value:</b> Mobile number verified in Sl. No 2 and 3, masked as +91 + first digit + XXXX + last 4 digits</p><p><b>Action:</b> Display only, not editable</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"prd-assets/f09-refresh.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Refresh</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTA</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the MF Central fetch is tried again <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-21\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-21');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-21\">Pending \u00b7 P-21</a></p></div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>Module 5 \u2013 Mutual Fund Portfolio Fetching</h2>\n<p class=\"screens\">MF Central pages (owned by MF Central \u2013 LOS has no access; issues raised to MF Central by mail): Screen 07.2) OTP \u00b7 07.3) Select AMCs \u00b7 07.4) Portfolio Fetching \u00b7 07.5) Portfolio Discovery Complete</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th style=\"width:52px\">SL.No</th><th style=\"width:330px\">Screenshot</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Functionality</th><th>Description</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Data Points Required</th><th style=\"width:165px\">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr id=\"sl-8\"><td rowspan=\"4\" class=\"sl\">8</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-08.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"4\">User entering the 6-digit OTP received from MF Central and clicking \u201cAuthenticate with OTP\u201d</td><td><p>After the redirection countdown (Sl. No 7), when MF Central has data for the PAN and mobile number combination, the customer is taken to the MF Central page (outside the LOS). MF Central sends a 6-digit OTP to the mobile number; the customer enters it and clicks Authenticate with OTP to authorise sharing of the mutual fund portfolio for Loan Against Mutual Funds. <b>MF Central page:</b> this page is owned and run by MF Central, outside the LOS \u2013 the LOS redirects the customer to MF Central and MF Central redirects the customer back to the LOS when its process is complete. The LOS has no access to change it; any functional issue on this page is raised to MF Central by mail.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Logo:</b> MF Central logo</li><li><b>Usecase card:</b> \u201cUsecase: Loan Against Mutual Funds\u201d; \u201cBy authenticating, you authorize requesting platform registered with SEBI/RBI to securely access your mutual fund portfolio data from MF Central for Loan Against Mutual Funds\u201d</li><li><b>OTP label:</b> \u201cEnter your 6-digit OTP\u201d</li><li><b>OTP boxes:</b> 6 boxes; the digits are masked as dots</li><li><b>CTA:</b> \u201cAuthenticate with OTP\u201d \u2013 light until all 6 digits are entered, then dark</li><li><b>Security card:</b> \u201cSecure Authentication for Portfolio Access\u201d: We do not store your OTP or sensitive credentials; Data is end to end encrypted and securely shared only on authentication of OTP by Investor; Access is limited to Personal Finance Management only; Consent artifact is valid for one time data sharing; MF Central follows an every time consent model for sharing the data</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"4\" class=\"dp\"><b>MF Central OTP Authenticated Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS<br><br><b>MF Central OTP Status:</b><ul><li>Success</li><li>Failure</li></ul></td><td rowspan=\"4\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Completed</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f08-usecase.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Usecase card</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Display</p><p><b>Action:</b> Shows the use case (Loan Against Mutual Funds) and the authorisation text \u2013 display only.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f08-otp.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Before \u2013 empty</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f08-otp-filled.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>After \u2013 6 digits entered, shown as dots</figcaption></figure></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Enter your 6-digit OTP</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> OTP field (6 boxes)</p><p><b>Minimum Character:</b> 6 Char</p><p><b>Maximum Character:</b> 6 Char</p><p><b>Input Value format:</b> Numeric, masked</p><p><b>Action:</b> User has to enter the 6-digit OTP received from MF Central on the mobile number.</p><p><b>Validation:</b> Wrong OTP handling is done by MF Central (not controlled by the LOS).</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f08-auth.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Before \u2013 light, until 6 digits are entered</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f08-auth-enabled.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>After \u2013 enabled once 6 digits are entered</figcaption></figure></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Authenticate with OTP</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTA (Button)</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click with the correct OTP, the customer moves to Select AMCs (Sl. No 9).</p><p><b>Condition:</b> Enabled only when all 6 digits are entered.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-9\"><td rowspan=\"4\" class=\"sl\">9</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-10.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"4\">User selecting the AMCs whose mutual funds are to be fetched and clicking \u201cContinue to Portfolio Import\u201d</td><td><p>MF Central lists every AMC in which the customer holds mutual funds, with the market value of the holding. The customer selects the AMCs to share; only the funds of the selected AMCs are fetched \u2013 funds of AMCs that are not selected are not fetched. <b>MF Central page:</b> this page is owned and run by MF Central, outside the LOS \u2013 the LOS redirects the customer to MF Central and MF Central redirects the customer back to the LOS when its process is complete. The LOS has no access to change it; any functional issue on this page is raised to MF Central by mail.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Logo:</b> MF Central logo</li><li><b>Usecase:</b> \u201cUsecase: Loan Against Mutual Funds\u201d</li><li><b>Title:</b> \u201cSelect AMCs for Loan Assessment\u201d</li><li><b>Select all:</b> \u201cSelect All AMCs\u201d checkbox</li><li><b>AMC list:</b> One row per AMC: checkbox, AMC logo, AMC name (e.g. DSP Mutual Fund, HDFC Mutual Fund, PPFAS Mutual Fund, Shriram Mutual Fund) and \u201cMARKET VALUE\u201d (e.g. \u20b920,008.48)</li><li><b>CTA:</b> \u201cContinue to Portfolio Import\u201d \u2013 grey until at least one AMC is selected</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"4\" class=\"dp\"><b>AMCs Listed:</b> names and market values shown<br><br><b>AMCs Selected:</b> names of the selected AMCs<br><br><b>Continue Clicked Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td rowspan=\"4\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Completed</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f10-selectall.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Before \u2013 unticked</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f10-selectall-ticked.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>After \u2013 ticked</figcaption></figure></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Select All AMCs</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Check box</p><p><b>Action:</b> Ticking selects every AMC in the list; unticking clears them all.</p><p><b>Condition:</b> Ticked automatically when every AMC is selected one by one; unticked when any AMC is unselected.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f10-amc.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Before \u2013 not selected</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f10-amc-ticked.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>After \u2013 selected (row highlighted)</figcaption></figure></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> AMC row</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Check box with AMC logo, name and market value</p><p><b>Action:</b> User ticks each AMC whose funds are to be fetched.</p><p><b>Condition:</b> Only the selected AMCs\u2019 funds are fetched; unselected AMCs\u2019 funds are not fetched.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f10-cta.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Before \u2013 disabled (grey) until an AMC is selected</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f10-cta-enabled.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>After \u2013 enabled</figcaption></figure></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Continue to Portfolio Import</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTA (Button)</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, MF Central starts fetching the portfolio of the selected AMCs (Sl. No 10).</p><p><b>Condition:</b> Disabled until at least one AMC is selected.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-10\"><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"sl\">10</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-10-fetch.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"3\">MF Central fetching the mutual fund portfolio of the selected AMCs</td><td><p>After Continue to Portfolio Import, MF Central shows the Fetching Your Portfolio screen while it connects and fetches the portfolio of the selected AMCs. No action is needed from the customer; when the fetch is complete the Portfolio Discovery Complete screen is shown (Sl. No 11). <b>MF Central page:</b> this page is owned and run by MF Central, outside the LOS \u2013 the LOS redirects the customer to MF Central and MF Central redirects the customer back to the LOS when its process is complete. The LOS has no access to change it; any functional issue on this page is raised to MF Central by mail.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Logo:</b> MF Central logo</li><li><b>Icon:</b> Portfolio icon with an arrow</li><li><b>Title:</b> \u201cFetching Your Portfolio...\u201d</li><li><b>Sub text:</b> \u201cConnecting to MF Central and fetching your investment data\u201d</li><li><b>Progress steps:</b> \u201cConnecting to MF Central\u201d (purple bar, loading icon) and \u201cFetching your portfolio\u201d (green bar, shield icon)</li><li><b>Status line:</b> \u201cProcessing portfolio data\u201d with three dots</li><li><b>Footer:</b> \u201c256-bit encryption\u201d \u00b7 \u201cISO 27001 compliant\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"dp\"><b>Portfolio Fetch Started Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS<br><br><b>Portfolio Fetch Status:</b><ul><li>Success</li><li>Failure</li></ul></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Completed</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f10-steps.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Progress steps</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Progress bars</p><p><b>Action:</b> Shows the two steps \u2013 Connecting to MF Central, then Fetching your portfolio \u2013 as they progress; display only.</p><p><b>Condition:</b> Failure handling is done by MF Central (not controlled by the LOS).</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f10-processing.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Processing portfolio data</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Status text</p><p><b>Action:</b> Display only, shown while the data is processed. When the fetch completes the customer moves to Sl. No 11 automatically.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-11\"><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"sl\">11</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-11.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"3\">Portfolio Discovery Complete \u2013 MF Central confirms the fetch and redirects the customer back to the LOS</td><td><p>When the portfolio is fetched, MF Central shows the Portfolio Discovery Complete screen and redirects the customer back to the LOS within 3 seconds (\u201cRedirecting in 3s\u201d counting down to 0s), to the Redirecting to Dashboard page in the LOS (Sl. No 12). <b>MF Central page:</b> this page is owned and run by MF Central, outside the LOS \u2013 the LOS redirects the customer to MF Central and MF Central redirects the customer back to the LOS when its process is complete. The LOS has no access to change it; any functional issue on this page is raised to MF Central by mail.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Logo:</b> MF Central logo</li><li><b>Icon:</b> Green tick</li><li><b>Title:</b> \u201cPortfolio Discovery Complete!\u201d</li><li><b>Message:</b> \u201cYour mutual fund portfolio has been successfully fetched and will now be sent to the Requested Platform.\u201d</li><li><b>Status:</b> \u201cData fetched successfully\u201d \u2013 \u201cAll portfolio information secured\u201d</li><li><b>Redirect:</b> \u201cRedirecting in Ns\u201d with an arrow \u2013 N counts down from 3 to 0</li><li><b>Footer:</b> \u201c256-bit encryption\u201d \u00b7 \u201cISO 27001 compliant\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"dp\"><b>Portfolio Fetch Completed Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS<br><br><b>Redirected to LOS Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td rowspan=\"3\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Completed</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f12-status.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Data fetched successfully</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Status banner</p><p><b>Action:</b> Confirms the portfolio was fetched \u2013 display only.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f12-redirect.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Redirecting in Ns</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Timer</p><p><b>Action:</b> Counts down from 3 seconds to 0; then the customer is redirected to the LOS \u2013 Redirecting to Dashboard (Sl. No 12).</p></div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>Module 6 \u2013 Mutual Fund Portfolio Processing</h2>\n<p class=\"screens\">Screen 08) MF Central to LOS Redirecting Page \u00b7 09) Fetching Mutual Fund Portfolio \u00b7 10) Analysing Mutual Fund Portfolio \u00b7 11) Generating Loan Offers</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th style=\"width:52px\">SL.No</th><th style=\"width:330px\">Screenshot</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Functionality</th><th>Description</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Data Points Required</th><th style=\"width:165px\">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr id=\"sl-12\"><td class=\"sl\">12</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-13.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td>Customer returns from MF Central to the LOS \u2013 Redirecting to Dashboard</td><td><p>After MF Central redirects the customer back (Sl. No 11), the LOS shows the Redirecting to Dashboard screen. No action is needed from the customer; the Fetching Mutual Fund Portfolio screen opens automatically (Sl. No 13).</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Header:</b> Top navigation \u2013 see Sl. No 6</li><li><b>Message:</b> \u201cRedirecting to Dashboard...\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td class=\"dp\"><b>Returned to LOS Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td><span class=\"tag ok\">Completed</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-13\"><td class=\"sl\">13</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-14.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td>LOS fetching the mutual fund portfolio received from MF Central</td><td><p>The LOS shows a loader pop up over the Credit Limit Against Mutual Fund page while it fetches the mutual fund portfolio shared by MF Central. No action is needed from the customer; the next screen opens automatically (Sl. No 14).</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Loader:</b> Animated placeholder cards \u2013 only the loader pop up is shown; the page behind is blurred</li><li><b>Title:</b> \u201cFetching your mutual fund portfolio..\u201d</li><li><b>Sub text:</b> \u201cThis might take a min, thanks for your patience\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td class=\"dp\"><b>Portfolio Received in LOS Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS<br><br><b>Portfolio Fetch Status:</b><ul><li>Success</li><li>Failure</li></ul></td><td><span class=\"tag ok\">Completed</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-14\"><td class=\"sl\">14</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-15.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td>LOS analysing the mutual fund portfolio</td><td><p>The LOS shows a loader pop up over the (blurred) Curated Offers page while it analyses the portfolio \u2013 eligible and non eligible funds and their values. No action is needed from the customer; the next screen opens automatically (Sl. No 15).</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Loader:</b> Animated placeholder cards \u2013 only the loader pop up is shown; the page behind is blurred</li><li><b>Title:</b> \u201cAnalyzing your mutual fund portfolio..\u201d</li><li><b>Sub text:</b> \u201cThis might take a min, thanks for your patience\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td class=\"dp\"><b>Portfolio Analysis Completed Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td><span class=\"tag ok\">Completed</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-15\"><td class=\"sl\">15</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-16-gen.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td>LOS generating the best loan offers</td><td><p>The LOS shows a loader pop up over the (blurred) Curated Offers page while it generates the loan offers from the analysed portfolio. No action is needed from the customer; the next screen opens automatically (the Curated Offers page, Sl. No 16).</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Loader:</b> Animated placeholder cards \u2013 only the loader pop up is shown; the page behind is blurred</li><li><b>Title:</b> \u201cGenerating best loan offers for you\u201d</li><li><b>Sub text:</b> \u201cThis might take a min, thanks for your patience\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td class=\"dp\"><b>Loan Offers Generated Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>Module 7 \u2013 Curated Offers</h2>\n<p class=\"screens\">Screen 12) Curated Offers Page \u00b7 12.1.1 \u2013 12.1.3) How is it calculated \u00b7 12.2) Refresh portfolio \u00b7 12.2) Curated offers page for drop off view</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th style=\"width:52px\">SL.No</th><th style=\"width:330px\">Screenshot</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Functionality</th><th>Description</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Data Points Required</th><th style=\"width:165px\">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr id=\"sl-16\"><td rowspan=\"12\" class=\"sl\">16</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-16.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"12\">Customer viewing the credit limit and loan offer worked out from the mutual fund portfolio, and starting the application</td><td><p>After the loan offers are generated (Sl. No 15), the customer lands on the Curated Offers page. It shows the credit limit worked out from the eligible mutual fund portfolio, the interest rate, processing fee and tenure, the total portfolio value and every mutual fund fetched from MF Central. A green toast \u201cPortfolio fetched successfully\u201d confirms the portfolio was retrieved and disappears after 3 seconds. The customer clicks Start Application to continue to the mutual fund selection (location access Sl. No 17.1, then Sl. No 17). The 18 to 70 years age limit (from the DOB entered in Sl. No 4) is checked on this page. Written from the prototype screen \u2013 to be checked against UAT <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-23\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-23');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-23\">Pending \u00b7 P-23</a></p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Header:</b> Top navigation \u2013 see Sl. No 6</li><li><b>Banner:</b> Ticker \u2013 scrolls up through three messages one after another and repeats: \u201cBorrow only what you need and pay interest only on the utilised amount\u201d, \u201cAvail a loan of up to 75% of your eligible Mutual Fund portfolio\u201d, \u201cQuick digital process with fast loan disbursal\u201d</li><li><b>Title:</b> \u201cCurated offers for you\u201d</li><li><b>Sub text:</b> \u201cProcessing fee and monthly EMI shown are indicative. Final values will depend on the actual loan amount availed.\u201d</li><li><b>Offer card:</b> \u201cCredit Limit\u201d with the amount (e.g. \u20b9 6,19,13,200, underlined link); \u201cInterest Rate\u201d (e.g. 10.50% p.a.), \u201cProcessing Fee\u201d (e.g. \u20b9 3,09,566), \u201cTenure in Months\u201d (e.g. 12); \u201cKFS document\u201d with an arrow; CTA \u201cStart Application\u201d</li><li><b>Portfolio summary:</b> \u201cTotal Portfolio Value\u201d (e.g. \u20b9 12,04,62,749.99); \u201cLast updated: DD-MM-YYYY HH:MM:SS\u201d with \u201cRefresh portfolio\u201d</li><li><b>Mobile strip:</b> Masked mobile number (e.g. +919XXXX1623), number of securities and total value (e.g. 13 Security \u2022 \u20b9 12,04,62,749.99)</li><li><b>Fund cards:</b> One card per mutual fund: AMC logo, fund name, \u201cFolio No.\u201d, \u201cNo. of Units\u201d, \u201cCurrent Value\u201d</li><li><b>Validation message:</b> \u201cApplicant must be between 18 to 70 years of age.\u201d \u2013 when the customer\u2019s age is outside 18 to 70 <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-18\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-18');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-18\">Pending \u00b7 P-18</a></li><li><b>Success toast:</b> \u201cPortfolio fetched successfully\u201d \u2013 shown at the bottom of the page when the customer lands here after the portfolio is retrieved from MF Central; \u201cPortfolio refreshed successfully\u201d after Refresh Portfolio (Sl. No 16.2). Disappears automatically after 3 seconds</li></ul></div><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Drop off:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>When:</b> The customer leaves the journey on this page without clicking Start Application</li><li><b>On return:</b> After logging in again with the mobile number (Sl. No 2) and OTP (Sl. No 3), the customer lands on the drop off view of this page (Sl. No 16.3) <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-23\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-23');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-23\">Pending \u00b7 P-23</a></li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"12\" class=\"dp\"><b>Credit Limit:</b> amount<br><br><b>Interest Rate:</b> % p.a.<br><br><b>Processing Fee:</b> amount<br><br><b>Tenure in Months:</b> number<br><br><b>Total Portfolio Value:</b> amount<br><br><b>Number of Securities:</b> number<br><br><b>Age Check:</b><ul><li>Within 18 to 70</li><li>Outside 18 to 70</li></ul><br><b>KFS document Clicked:</b><ul><li>Yes</li><li>No</li></ul><br><b>Curated Offers Viewed Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS<br><br><b>Start Application Clicked Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td rowspan=\"12\"><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f16-tk1.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Message 1</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f16-tk2.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Message 2</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f16-tk3.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Message 3</figcaption></figure></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Info banner (ticker)</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Ticker \u2013 vertical scrolling text</p><p><b>Action:</b> Display only. The banner holds three messages; each one scrolls up and is replaced by the next, then the ticker starts again from the first:<ol><li>\u201cBorrow only what you need and pay interest only on the utilised amount\u201d</li><li>\u201cAvail a loan of up to 75% of your eligible Mutual Fund portfolio\u201d</li><li>\u201cQuick digital process with fast loan disbursal\u201d</li></ol></p><p><b>Condition:</b> Shown on the Curated Offers page and its drop off view (Sl. No 16.3). How long each message stays on screen to be confirmed <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-23\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-23');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-23\">Pending \u00b7 P-23</a></p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f16-cl.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Credit Limit</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Amount (hyperlink)</p><p><b>Action:</b> Shows the maximum credit limit worked out from the eligible portfolio. On click, the How is it calculated page opens (Sl. No 16.1).</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f16-offer.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Interest Rate, Processing Fee, Tenure in Months</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Display values</p><p><b>Action:</b> Show the offer terms \u2013 display only. Processing fee is indicative; the final value depends on the loan amount availed.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f16-kfs.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> KFS document</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Link row with arrow</p><p><b>Action:</b> Opens the Key Fact Statement (KFS) for the offer. What it opens (document / pop up / download) to be confirmed <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-23\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-23');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-23\">Pending \u00b7 P-23</a></p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f16-start.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Enabled \u2013 age within 18 to 70</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f16-offer-age.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Disabled \u2013 age outside 18 to 70</figcaption></figure></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Start Application</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTA (Button)</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the customer continues to the mutual fund selection \u2013 location access (Sl. No 17.1), then the Mutual Fund Selection page (Sl. No 17).</p><p><b>Condition:</b> When the customer\u2019s age (from the DOB entered in Sl. No 4) is outside 18 to 70, the CTA is disabled and the age message is shown.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f16-age.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Age validation</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Validation message</p><p><b>Validation:</b> \u201cApplicant must be between 18 to 70 years of age.\u201d \u2013 shown on this page only, when the age is outside 18 to 70 (customers are not blocked at PAN verification, so they can be tracked). Exact position on the page to be confirmed <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-18\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-18');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-18\">Pending \u00b7 P-18</a></p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f16-tpv.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Total Portfolio Value</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Display value</p><p><b>Action:</b> Total current value of all the mutual funds fetched \u2013 display only.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f16-lu.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Last updated / Refresh portfolio</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Display date and time + hyperlink</p><p><b>Action:</b> Shows when the portfolio was last fetched. On clicking Refresh portfolio, the Refresh portfolio pop up opens (Sl. No 16.2).</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f16-strip.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Mobile strip</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Display</p><p><b>Action:</b> Masked mobile number, number of securities and total value \u2013 display only.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f16-toast.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>After the portfolio is fetched</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f16-toast-refresh.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>After Refresh Portfolio</figcaption></figure></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Portfolio success toast</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Toast message (green, bottom of the page)</p><p><b>Action:</b> \u201cPortfolio fetched successfully\u201d is shown when the customer lands on this page after the portfolio is retrieved from MF Central (Sl. No 12 \u2013 15). After Refresh Portfolio (Sl. No 16.2) the toast reads \u201cPortfolio refreshed successfully\u201d.</p><p><b>Condition:</b> Disappears automatically after 3 seconds; it is not shown when the page is opened again without a new fetch.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f16-fund.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Fund card</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Display card (one per fund)</p><p><b>Action:</b> AMC logo, fund name, Folio No., No. of Units and Current Value of each fund \u2013 display only.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-16.1\"><td rowspan=\"6\" class=\"sl\">16.1</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-16-1.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"6\">Customer viewing how the credit limit is calculated \u2013 All, Eligible and Non-Eligible portfolio</td><td><p>Opened by clicking the Credit Limit amount on the Curated Offers page (Sl. No 16). It explains the credit limit: total portfolio value, minus the non-eligible portfolio, gives the eligible portfolio and the credit limit available. Three tabs list the funds \u2013 All, Eligible Portfolio and Non-Eligible Portfolio; non-eligible funds carry a \u201cNot Eligible\u201d strip and a credit limit of \u20b9 0.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Header:</b> Top navigation \u2013 see Sl. No 6</li><li><b>Back link:</b> \u201cLoan Against Mutual Funds\u201d with the back arrow</li><li><b>Credit limit:</b> \u201cYour maximum credit limit is\u201d with the amount and a coins image</li><li><b>Description:</b> \u201cWe determine your credit limit based on your eligible mutual fund portfolio and our lending policies. This is the maximum amount you can borrow.\u201d</li><li><b>Calculation:</b> \u201cTotal Portfolio Value\u201d, \u201cNon-Eligible Portfolio Value\u201d (minus), \u201cEligible Portfolio Value\u201d, \u201cCredit Limit Available\u201d</li><li><b>Tabs:</b> \u201cAll\u201d, \u201cEligible Portfolio\u201d, \u201cNon-Eligible Portfolio\u201d</li><li><b>Mobile strip:</b> Masked mobile number and number of securities in the selected tab</li><li><b>Fund cards:</b> AMC logo, fund name, \u201cFolio No.\u201d, \u201cPledgeable Units\u201d, \u201cCurrent Value\u201d, \u201cCredit Limit\u201d; \u201cNot Eligible\u201d strip on non-eligible funds</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"6\" class=\"dp\"><b>Tab Viewed:</b><ul><li>All</li><li>Eligible Portfolio</li><li>Non-Eligible Portfolio</li></ul><br><b>How is it calculated Viewed Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td rowspan=\"6\"><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f161-back.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Loan Against Mutual Funds (back)</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Back link</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the customer returns to the Curated Offers page (Sl. No 16).</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f161-rows.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Credit limit calculation</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Display values</p><p><b>Action:</b> Total Portfolio Value \u2212 Non-Eligible Portfolio Value = Eligible Portfolio Value; Credit Limit Available is worked out from the eligible value \u2013 display only.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f161-tabs.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>All</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f161-tabs-el.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Eligible Portfolio</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"state\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f161-tabs-ne.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Non-Eligible Portfolio</figcaption></figure></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Tabs</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Tabs</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the fund list shows all funds, only eligible funds (sorted by credit limit) or only non-eligible funds; the selected tab is highlighted.</p><p><b>Condition:</b> All is selected by default.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f161-card.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Fund card</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Display card</p><p><b>Action:</b> Pledgeable Units, Current Value and Credit Limit of the fund \u2013 display only.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f161-ne.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Not Eligible fund</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Display card with strip</p><p><b>Action:</b> A fund that cannot be pledged shows the \u201cNot Eligible\u201d strip and Credit Limit \u20b9 0.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-16.2\"><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"sl\">16.2</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-16-2.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"3\">Customer refreshing the linked mutual fund portfolio</td><td><p>Opened by clicking Refresh portfolio on the Curated Offers page. The pop up asks the customer to refresh all linked portfolios to see the current value of the investments and continue. Refresh Portfolio refreshes the portfolio and returns to the Curated Offers page with the toast \u201cPortfolio refreshed successfully\u201d. When the pop up is shown automatically is to be confirmed <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-23\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-23');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-23\">Pending \u00b7 P-23</a></p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Title:</b> \u201cRefresh all linked portfolios to continue\u201d</li><li><b>Text:</b> \u201cPlease refresh your portfolio to view the current value of your investments and continue with the application.\u201d</li><li><b>Portfolio box:</b> Masked mobile number, \u201cLast refreshed Today\u201d and \u201cRefresh Portfolio\u201d</li><li><b>Close icon:</b> (X) at the top right</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"dp\"><b>Refresh Portfolio Clicked Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td rowspan=\"3\"><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f162-box.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Refresh Portfolio</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Hyperlink</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the linked portfolio is refreshed: the pop up closes, the customer stays on the Curated Offers page, \u201cLast updated\u201d shows the date and time of this refresh and the green toast \u201cPortfolio refreshed successfully\u201d is shown for 3 seconds (Sl. No 16).</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> (X) Close icon</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Icon</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the pop up closes and the customer stays on the Curated Offers page.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-16.3\"><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"sl\">16.3</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-16-3.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"3\">Curated Offers page for a customer who dropped off and came back</td><td><p>A customer who left on the Curated Offers page and logs in again sees the drop off view of the page: a progress strip on the offer card and two CTAs, Discard and Continue, in place of Start Application. The rest of the page is the same as Sl. No 16.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Banner:</b> Same ticker as Sl. No 16</li><li><b>Progress strip:</b> \u201c1/4 Complete your application to get cash\u201d</li><li><b>CTAs:</b> \u201cDiscard\u201d and \u201cContinue\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"dp\"><b>Drop off View Shown Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS<br><br><b>CTA Clicked:</b><ul><li>Continue</li><li>Discard</li></ul></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f163-prog.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Progress strip</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Display text</p><p><b>Action:</b> \u201c1/4 Complete your application to get cash\u201d \u2013 shows the application step the customer is on.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f163-btns.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Discard / Continue</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTAs</p><p><b>Action:</b> Continue: the customer continues the application \u2013 location access (Sl. No 17.1), then the Mutual Fund Selection page (Sl. No 17). Discard: to be confirmed <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-23\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-23');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-23\">Pending \u00b7 P-23</a></p></div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>Module 8 \u2013 Mutual Fund Selection</h2>\n<p class=\"screens\">Screen 13.1) Location access \u00b7 13.2) Mutual Fund Selection Page \u00b7 13.3) Location disabled \u00b7 13.4) Ongoing application pop up \u00b7 13.5) Loan amount edit \u00b7 13.6) Fund wise amount edit</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th style=\"width:52px\">SL.No</th><th style=\"width:330px\">Screenshot</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Functionality</th><th>Description</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Data Points Required</th><th style=\"width:165px\">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr id=\"sl-17\"><td rowspan=\"7\" class=\"sl\">17</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-17.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"7\">Customer choosing the loan amount and the mutual funds to pledge</td><td><p>After Start Application on the Curated Offers page (Sl. No 16) and location access (Sl. No 17.1), the customer lands on the Mutual Fund Selection page, step 1 of 4. The loan amount is set with the slider or typed (Sl. No 17.4); the LOS selects the funds needed to cover it. The customer can also tick or untick funds and edit the amount taken from each fund (Sl. No 17.5). Continue to apply opens the Loan Application Summary (Sl. No 18). Written from the prototype screen \u2013 to be checked against UAT <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-24\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-24');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-24\">Pending \u00b7 P-24</a></p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Header:</b> Top navigation \u2013 see Sl. No 6</li><li><b>Stepper:</b> \u201c1 Selection of Mutual Fund\u201d, \u201c2 KYC Verification &amp; Bank details\u201d, \u201c3 Pledging of Mutual Fund\u201d, \u201c4 Agreement &amp; E-Mandate\u201d \u2013 step 1 active</li><li><b>Back link:</b> \u201cBack\u201d</li><li><b>Loan amount box:</b> \u201cLoan Amount\u201d with the amount and edit pencil; slider from \u201c\u20b9 10,000\u201d to the credit limit (e.g. \u20b9 2,00,00,000)</li><li><b>Selection summary:</b> \u201cFunds selected for pledging\u201d; \u201cCurrent market value of units selected for pledging\u201d with the amount; \u201cNo. of funds selected\u201d with the count</li><li><b>Select All:</b> Checkbox \u201cSelect All\u201d</li><li><b>Mobile strip:</b> Masked mobile number, number of funds and total value (e.g. 9 Fund \u2022 \u20b9 8,91,60,659.02)</li><li><b>Fund cards:</b> Checkbox, AMC logo, fund name, \u201cFolio No.\u201d, \u201cSelected Amount\u201d with edit pencil, \u201cNo of Units\u201d, \u201cCurrent Value\u201d, \u201cMax Limit\u201d (each with an (i) icon)</li><li><b>CTA:</b> \u201cContinue to apply \u20b9 amount\u201d</li></ul></div><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Drop off:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>When:</b> The customer leaves the journey on this page</li><li><b>On return:</b> After logging in again, the ongoing application pop up is shown (Sl. No 17.3) <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-24\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-24');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-24\">Pending \u00b7 P-24</a></li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"7\" class=\"dp\"><b>Loan Amount Selected:</b> amount<br><br><b>Funds Selected:</b> fund name, folio no., selected amount, units \u2013 per fund<br><br><b>Market Value of Units Selected:</b> amount<br><br><b>No. of Funds Selected:</b> number<br><br><b>Continue to apply Clicked Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td rowspan=\"7\"><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f17-stepper.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Stepper</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Display</p><p><b>Action:</b> Shows the 4 application steps; the current step is highlighted and completed steps carry a tick \u2013 display only.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f17-loan.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Loan Amount</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Slider + amount with edit pencil</p><p><b>Value Type:</b> Amount (\u20b9)</p><p><b>Action:</b> Moving the slider changes the loan amount; the funds to be pledged and the CTA amount are updated with it. On clicking the pencil, the amount can be typed (Sl. No 17.4).</p><p><b>Condition:</b> Minimum \u20b9 10,000; maximum is the credit limit from the Curated Offers page.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"prd-assets/f17-selall.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Select All</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Checkbox</p><p><b>Action:</b> Ticks or unticks every fund. Shown part-ticked (\u2013) when only some funds are selected.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f17-card.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Fund card</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Checkbox + display card</p><p><b>Action:</b> Ticking a fund adds it for pledging; unticking removes it. Selected Amount is the amount taken against the fund and can be edited with the pencil (Sl. No 17.5). No of Units, Current Value and Max Limit are display only.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f17-cta.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Continue to apply</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTA (Button)</p><p><b>Action:</b> Shows the selected loan amount. On click, the Loan Application Summary opens (Sl. No 18).</p><p><b>Condition:</b> Disabled while the loan amount is being edited (Sl. No 17.4) or location access is not given (Sl. No 17.2).</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Back</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Link</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the customer returns to the Curated Offers page (Sl. No 16).</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-17.1\"><td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"sl\">17.1</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-17-1.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Browser asking the customer for location access</td><td><p>When the customer starts the application, the browser asks for permission to read the location. Allow or Just this Time opens the Mutual Fund Selection page (Sl. No 17); Block shows the location disabled view (Sl. No 17.2). The pop up is the browser\u2019s own; its look depends on the browser.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Title:</b> \u201cuatlamf.shriramcredit.in wants to\u201d</li><li><b>Text:</b> \u201cKnow your location\u201d</li><li><b>Buttons:</b> \u201cBlock\u201d, \u201cJust this Time\u201d, \u201cAllow\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"dp\"><b>Location Permission:</b><ul><li>Allowed</li><li>Allowed this time</li><li>Blocked</li></ul><br><b>Customer Location:</b> latitude, longitude<br><br><b>Location Captured Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td rowspan=\"2\"><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f171-perm.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Location permission</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Browser pop up</p><p><b>Action:</b> Allow / Just this Time: the location is captured and the Mutual Fund Selection page opens. Block: the location disabled view opens (Sl. No 17.2).</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-17.2\"><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"sl\">17.2</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-17-2.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"3\">Mutual Fund Selection page when location access is blocked</td><td><p>When the customer blocks location access, the Mutual Fund Selection page shows a message asking for location access and Continue to apply stays disabled. Refresh asks for the location again (Sl. No 17.1).</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Message:</b> \u201cKindly provide location access in order to proceed with the loan application.\u201d with \u201cRefresh\u201d</li><li><b>CTA:</b> \u201cContinue to apply \u20b9 amount\u201d \u2013 disabled</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"dp\"><b>Location Blocked Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td rowspan=\"3\"><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f172-toast.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Location message</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Message with hyperlink</p><p><b>Action:</b> On clicking Refresh, the browser location pop up is shown again (Sl. No 17.1).</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f172-cta.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Continue to apply</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTA (Button) \u2013 disabled</p><p><b>Condition:</b> Stays disabled until location access is given.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-17.3\"><td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"sl\">17.3</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-17-3.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Customer with an ongoing application choosing to continue it</td><td><p>A customer who already has an application in progress is asked whether to continue it. Yes, Continue opens the Mutual Fund Selection page (Sl. No 17); No, Take me to the dashboard returns to the Curated Offers page (Sl. No 16). When exactly this pop up is shown is to be confirmed <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-24\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-24');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-24\">Pending \u00b7 P-24</a></p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Text:</b> \u201cYou have an ongoing loan application, would you like to proceed further with it?\u201d</li><li><b>CTAs:</b> \u201cNo, Take me to the dashboard\u201d and \u201cYes, Continue\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"dp\"><b>Ongoing Application Choice:</b><ul><li>Yes, Continue</li><li>No, Take me to the dashboard</li></ul></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f173-modal.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> No, Take me to the dashboard / Yes, Continue</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTAs</p><p><b>Action:</b> Yes, Continue: the Mutual Fund Selection page opens. No, Take me to the dashboard: the Curated Offers page opens.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-17.4\"><td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"sl\">17.4</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-17-4.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Customer typing the loan amount</td><td><p>On clicking the pencil next to the loan amount, the amount becomes an input box with an Update link. Continue to apply is disabled until the customer clicks Update; then the funds and the CTA amount are recalculated for the typed amount.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Loan amount box:</b> \u201cLoan Amount\u201d, \u201c\u20b9\u201d input with the amount and \u201cUpdate\u201d</li><li><b>CTA:</b> \u201cContinue to apply \u20b9 amount\u201d \u2013 disabled while editing</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"dp\"><b>Loan Amount Entered:</b> amount</td><td rowspan=\"2\"><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f174-loan.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Loan Amount</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Input box + Update link</p><p><b>Value Type:</b> Numeric</p><p><b>Action:</b> On clicking Update, the slider, the selected funds and the CTA amount change to the typed amount.</p><p><b>Condition:</b> Minimum \u20b9 10,000; maximum is the credit limit.</p><p><b>Validation:</b> Message for an amount below the minimum or above the credit limit \u2013 to be confirmed <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-24\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-24');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-24\">Pending \u00b7 P-24</a></p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-17.5\"><td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"sl\">17.5</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-17-5.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Customer editing the amount taken from one fund</td><td><p>On clicking the pencil next to a fund\u2019s Selected Amount, the amount becomes an input box with a tick. The customer types the amount to take from that fund (up to its Max Limit) and confirms it with the tick; the loan amount and CTA amount are updated.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Fund card:</b> \u201cSelected Amount\u201d input with the tick, \u201cNo of Units\u201d, \u201cCurrent Value\u201d, \u201cMax Limit\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"dp\"><b>Selected Amount per Fund:</b> amount</td><td rowspan=\"2\"><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f175-card.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Selected Amount</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Input box + tick</p><p><b>Value Type:</b> Numeric</p><p><b>Action:</b> On clicking the tick, the amount is saved for the fund and the loan amount is updated.</p><p><b>Condition:</b> Up to the Max Limit of the fund.</p><p><b>Validation:</b> Message for an amount above the Max Limit \u2013 to be confirmed <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-24\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-24');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-24\">Pending \u00b7 P-24</a></p></div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>Module 9 \u2013 Loan Application Summary</h2>\n<p class=\"screens\">Screen 14) Loan Application Summary</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th style=\"width:52px\">SL.No</th><th style=\"width:330px\">Screenshot</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Functionality</th><th>Description</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Data Points Required</th><th style=\"width:165px\">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr id=\"sl-18\"><td rowspan=\"4\" class=\"sl\">18</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-18.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"4\">Customer reviewing the loan terms and charges before KYC</td><td><p>After Continue to apply (Sl. No 17), the customer sees the summary of the application: loan amount, pledge value, tenure, disbursement and repayment type, interest rate, monthly interest, charges and repayment details. Continue opens KYC Verification (Sl. No 19); Back returns to the Mutual Fund Selection page. Written from the prototype screen \u2013 to be checked against UAT <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-24\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-24');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-24\">Pending \u00b7 P-24</a></p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Header:</b> Top navigation \u2013 see Sl. No 6; stepper \u2013 step 1 active</li><li><b>Back link:</b> \u201cBack\u201d</li><li><b>Title:</b> \u201cApplication details\u201d</li><li><b>Amount box:</b> \u201cLoan amount\u201d and \u201cPledge Value\u201d</li><li><b>Terms:</b> \u201cTenure\u201d (e.g. 12 months), \u201cDisbursement Type\u201d (Multiple), \u201cRepayment Type\u201d (Interest Only)</li><li><b>Rate box:</b> \u201cInterest Rate\u201d (e.g. 10.5% p.a) and \u201cMonthly Interest\u201d (e.g. \u20b9 1,35,940.88), each with an (i) icon</li><li><b>Charges:</b> \u201cCharges (Inclusive of GST)\u201d: \u201cProcessing fee\u201d, \u201cStamp duty\u201d, \u201cLien Marking Charges\u201d, \u201cLien Removal Charges\u201d, each with an (i) icon</li><li><b>Repayment details:</b> \u201cInterest autopay\u201d \u2013 \u201c5th of every month\u201d</li><li><b>CTA:</b> \u201cContinue\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"4\" class=\"dp\"><b>Loan Amount:</b> amount<br><br><b>Pledge Value:</b> amount<br><br><b>Tenure:</b> months<br><br><b>Disbursement Type:</b> Multiple<br><br><b>Repayment Type:</b> Interest Only<br><br><b>Interest Rate:</b> % p.a<br><br><b>Monthly Interest:</b> amount<br><br><b>Processing fee, Stamp duty, Lien Marking Charges, Lien Removal Charges:</b> amount each<br><br><b>Summary Continue Clicked Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td rowspan=\"4\"><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f18-box.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Loan amount / Pledge Value</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Display values</p><p><b>Action:</b> Loan amount selected on Sl. No 17 and the market value of the units pledged \u2013 display only.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f18-rate.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Interest Rate / Monthly Interest</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Display values with (i)</p><p><b>Action:</b> Display only; the (i) icon explains the value. Monthly Interest is worked out on the loan amount.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f18-cta.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Continue</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTA (Button)</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, KYC Verification opens (Sl. No 19).</p></div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>Module 10 \u2013 KYC Verification</h2>\n<p class=\"screens\">Screen 16.1) KYC Verification Page \u00b7 16.2) View details pop up \u00b7 16.3) Email OTP pop up \u00b7 16.4) Email verified \u00b7 16.5.1 \u2013 16.5.7) Aadhaar verification with DigiLocker (Digio) \u00b7 16.5.8) Getting status \u00b7 16.5.9) Aadhaar verified</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th style=\"width:52px\">SL.No</th><th style=\"width:330px\">Screenshot</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Functionality</th><th>Description</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Data Points Required</th><th style=\"width:165px\">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr id=\"sl-19\"><td rowspan=\"5\" class=\"sl\">19</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-19.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"5\">Customer completing KYC \u2013 Email, PAN, Aadhaar, Photo and Bank Details</td><td><p>Step 2 of 4. The KYC Verification page lists five checks done one after the other: Email Verification, PAN Verification (already Complete from Sl. No 4), Aadhaar Verification with DigiLocker, Photo Verification and Bank Details. Only the current check is open; the later ones show Pending. Written from the prototype screen \u2013 to be checked against UAT <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-24\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-24');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-24\">Pending \u00b7 P-24</a></p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Header:</b> Top navigation \u2013 see Sl. No 6; stepper \u2013 step 1 ticked, step 2 active</li><li><b>Back link:</b> \u201cBack\u201d</li><li><b>Loan strip:</b> \u201cYour loan amount is \u20b9 amount\u201d with \u201cView details\u201d</li><li><b>Title:</b> \u201cKYC Verification\u201d \u2013 \u201cThis step is required as per our lending guidelines.\u201d</li><li><b>1 Email Verification:</b> Email input; \u201cWe will use this email address for all official communications related to your loan application and account.\u201d; CTA \u201cVerify\u201d</li><li><b>2 PAN Verification:</b> \u201cComplete\u201d</li><li><b>3 Aadhaar Verification with DigiLocker:</b> \u201cPending\u201d</li><li><b>4 Photo Verification:</b> \u201cPending\u201d</li><li><b>5 Bank Details:</b> \u201cPending\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"5\" class=\"dp\"><b>Email ID:</b> email address<br><br><b>KYC Page Viewed Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td rowspan=\"5\"><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f19-strip.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Your loan amount is / View details</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Display + hyperlink</p><p><b>Action:</b> On clicking View details, the Loan details pop up opens (Sl. No 19.1).</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Email Verification</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Input box</p><p><b>Value Type:</b> Email address</p><p><b>Validation:</b> Message for an empty or invalid email \u2013 to be confirmed <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-24\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-24');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-24\">Pending \u00b7 P-24</a></p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f19-verify.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Verify</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTA (Button)</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, an OTP is sent to the email and the Enter OTP pop up opens (Sl. No 19.2).</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Back</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Link</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the Loan Application Summary opens (Sl. No 18).</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-19.1\"><td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"sl\">19.1</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-19-1.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Customer viewing the loan details from the KYC page</td><td><p>Opened by View details on the KYC page. Shows the loan amount, the market value and number of mutual funds selected, and a card for each fund selected for pledging.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Title:</b> \u201cLoan details\u201d</li><li><b>Values:</b> \u201cLoan Amount\u201d, \u201cMarket Value of MF selected\u201d, \u201cNo. of MF selected\u201d</li><li><b>Sub title:</b> \u201cMutual Fund selected for pledging\u201d</li><li><b>Fund cards:</b> Fund name, \u201cFolio No.\u201d, \u201cSelected Amount\u201d, \u201cSelected Units\u201d, \u201cCurrent Value\u201d, \u201cMax Limit\u201d</li><li><b>Close icon:</b> (X) at the top right</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"dp\">No data captured</td><td rowspan=\"2\"><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f191-modal.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Loan details pop up</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Pop up</p><p><b>Action:</b> Display only. (X) closes the pop up and the customer stays on the KYC page.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-19.2\"><td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"sl\">19.2</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-19-2.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Customer verifying the email with OTP</td><td><p>A 6 digit OTP is sent to the email entered. Submit OTP is enabled once all 6 digits are entered; a correct OTP marks Email Verification Complete (Sl. No 19.3). Resend timer, attempts and wrong OTP message \u2013 to be confirmed <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-24\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-24');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-24\">Pending \u00b7 P-24</a></p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Title:</b> \u201cEnter OTP\u201d</li><li><b>Text:</b> \u201cA 6-digit OTP has been sent to your registered email address\u201d with the email</li><li><b>OTP boxes:</b> 6 boxes</li><li><b>Resend:</b> \u201cDidn\u2019t receive OTP?\u201d timer and \u201cResend OTP\u201d</li><li><b>CTA:</b> \u201cSubmit OTP\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"dp\"><b>Email OTP Verified:</b><ul><li>Yes</li><li>No</li></ul><br><b>Email Verified Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td rowspan=\"2\"><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f192-modal.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Enter OTP</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> 6 OTP boxes + CTA</p><p><b>Value Type:</b> Numeric</p><p><b>Action:</b> On Submit OTP with the correct OTP, the pop up closes and Email Verification shows Complete.</p><p><b>Condition:</b> Submit OTP is enabled only when all 6 digits are entered.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-19.3\"><td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"sl\">19.3</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-19-3.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Email verified \u2013 customer starting Aadhaar KYC</td><td><p>After the email is verified, Email Verification shows Complete and Aadhaar Verification with DigiLocker opens with Start KYC. Start KYC opens the Digio page (Sl. No 19.4).</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>1 Email Verification:</b> \u201cComplete\u201d</li><li><b>3 Aadhaar Verification with DigiLocker:</b> CTA \u201cStart KYC\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"dp\"><b>Start KYC Clicked Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td rowspan=\"2\"><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f193-start.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Start KYC</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTA (Button)</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the customer is taken to Digio to fetch the Aadhaar from DigiLocker (Sl. No 19.4).</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-19.4\"><td class=\"sl\">19.4</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-19-4.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td>Digio page \u2013 consent to fetch documents from DigiLocker</td><td><p>Digio page (third party). Shows the steps to fetch the documents and the documents requested (Aadhaar Card and PAN Verification Record) with the customer\u2019s consent. Proceed opens DigiLocker (Sl. No 19.5); Cancel returns to the KYC page.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Header:</b> Digio logo, \u201cSecured by digio\u201d</li><li><b>Title:</b> \u201cSteps to securely fetch documents\u201d</li><li><b>Steps:</b> \u201cEnter Aadhaar number\u201d, \u201cEnter OTP and PIN (optional)\u201d, \u201cSelect requested documents:\u201d (Aadhaar Card, PAN Verification Record), \u201cDocument fetch from DigiLocker\u201d</li><li><b>Requested:</b> \u201cRequested: Aadhaar Card | PAN Card\u201d with the consent text</li><li><b>Consent:</b> \u201cBy proceeding further I hereby authorize Digio to pull my documents from Digilocker and share with SHRIRAM CREDIT COMPANY LIMITED\u201d</li><li><b>CTAs:</b> \u201cCancel\u201d and \u201cProceed\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td class=\"dp\"><b>Digio Consent Given Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-19.5\"><td class=\"sl\">19.5</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-19-5.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td>DigiLocker \u2013 customer entering the Aadhaar number</td><td><p>DigiLocker page (third party). The customer enters the 12 digit Aadhaar number and clicks Next.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Title:</b> \u201cSign up\u201d \u2013 \u201cIt takes just a minute\u201d</li><li><b>Field:</b> \u201cEnter your Aadhaar Number\u201d \u2013 3 boxes of 4 digits</li><li><b>Text:</b> \u201cDigiLocker uses Aadhaar to enable authentic document access\u201d</li><li><b>CTA:</b> \u201cNext\u201d; link \u201cTry another way\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td class=\"dp\">Not captured by the LOS (entered on DigiLocker)</td><td><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-19.6\"><td class=\"sl\">19.6</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-19-6.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td>DigiLocker \u2013 customer entering the Aadhaar OTP</td><td><p>DigiLocker page (third party). An OTP is sent to the mobile number linked to the Aadhaar; the customer enters it and clicks Submit.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Title:</b> \u201cVerify Aadhaar OTP\u201d</li><li><b>Text:</b> \u201cDigiLocker has sent you an OTP to your registered mobile (xxxxxx1623)\u201d; \u201cPlease enter OTP to complete verification\u201d</li><li><b>CTA:</b> \u201cSubmit\u201d; \u201cDidn\u2019t get the OTP? Resend OTP\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td class=\"dp\">Not captured by the LOS (entered on DigiLocker)</td><td><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-19.7\"><td class=\"sl\">19.7</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-19-7.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td>DigiLocker \u2013 customer entering the Security PIN</td><td><p>DigiLocker page (third party), shown when the customer is already registered with DigiLocker. The customer enters the 6 digit Security PIN and clicks Done.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Title:</b> \u201cYou are already registered with DigiLocker\u201d</li><li><b>Field:</b> \u201cPlease enter your 6 digit Security PIN to Signin\u201d \u2013 6 boxes; \u201cForgot my PIN\u201d</li><li><b>CTA:</b> \u201cDone\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td class=\"dp\">Not captured by the LOS (entered on DigiLocker)</td><td><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-19.8\"><td class=\"sl\">19.8</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-19-8.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td>Digio fetching the documents</td><td><p>Digio page (third party). The documents are fetched from DigiLocker; no action is needed from the customer.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Message:</b> \u201cSecurely fetching documents\u201d \u2013 \u201cPlease do not refresh or close the window\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td class=\"dp\">No data captured</td><td><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-19.9\"><td class=\"sl\">19.9</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-19-9.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td>Digio \u2013 KYC process completed</td><td><p>Digio page (third party). Shown when the documents are fetched; the customer is redirected back to the LOS automatically.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Message:</b> \u201cKYC process completed\u201d \u2013 \u201cDo not close the window. You will be redirected.\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td class=\"dp\"><b>Digio KYC Completed Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-19.10\"><td class=\"sl\">19.10</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-19-10.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td>LOS \u2013 KYC successfully completed, redirecting</td><td><p>LOS page shown when the customer comes back from Digio; it returns to the KYC page automatically.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Message:</b> \u201cKYC successfully completed.\u201d \u2013 \u201cRedirecting you back to the process in 1 seconds\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td class=\"dp\"><b>Returned from Digio Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-19.11\"><td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"sl\">19.11</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-19-11.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"2\">KYC page \u2013 Aadhaar status being updated</td><td><p>Back on the KYC page, Aadhaar Verification shows Getting status while the Aadhaar details are received from DigiLocker. When the status is received, Aadhaar Verification shows Complete (Sl. No 19.12). What is shown if the status is not received in time \u2013 to be confirmed <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-24\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-24');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-24\">Pending \u00b7 P-24</a></p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Status:</b> \u201cGetting status\u201d \u2013 \u201cThis might take up to 2m:58s\u201d (count down)</li><li><b>Text:</b> \u201cYour Aadhaar details are being fetched from DigiLocker. This process may take a few minutes. Please keep this tab open and avoid refreshing the page.\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"dp\"><b>Aadhaar Fetch Status:</b><ul><li>Success</li><li>Failure</li></ul><br><b>Aadhaar Details Received Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td rowspan=\"2\"><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f1911-status.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Getting status</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Status (Button, not clickable) with timer</p><p><b>Action:</b> Counts down while the status is fetched \u2013 display only.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-19.12\"><td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"sl\">19.12</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/screen-19-12.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Aadhaar verified \u2013 customer starting Photo Verification</td><td><p>Aadhaar Verification shows Complete and Photo Verification opens with Start. The Photo Verification and Bank Details steps follow <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-24\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-24');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-24\">Pending \u00b7 P-24</a></p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>3 Aadhaar Verification with DigiLocker:</b> \u201cComplete\u201d</li><li><b>4 Photo Verification:</b> CTA \u201cStart\u201d</li><li><b>5 Bank Details:</b> \u201cPending\u201d</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"dp\"><b>Aadhaar Verified Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td rowspan=\"2\"><span class=\"tag wip\">WIP</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f1912-start.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Start (Photo Verification)</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTA (Button)</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the photo verification starts <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-24\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-24');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-24\">Pending \u00b7 P-24</a></p></div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>Top Navigation</h2>\n<p class=\"screens\">Screen 04) Enter PAN Details \u2013 logo and Logout only (Sl. No 6.3) \u00b7 every LOS page from Screen 05) LOS to MF Central Redirection consent page onwards (not on the MF Central pages or the Digio / DigiLocker pages) \u2013 logo, Credit Score and Profile (Sl. No 6, 6.1, 6.2)</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th style=\"width:52px\">SL.No</th><th style=\"width:330px\">Screenshot</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Functionality</th><th>Description</th><th style=\"width:190px\">Data Points Required</th><th style=\"width:165px\">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr id=\"sl-6\"><td rowspan=\"4\" class=\"sl\">6</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f06-topnav.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"4\">Top navigation shown on every page after PAN verification</td><td><p>The top navigation is shown at the top of every LOS page from Sl. No 5 onwards (it is not shown on the MF Central pages, Sl. No 8 \u2013 11, or on the Digio / DigiLocker pages and the KYC redirect page, Sl. No 19.4 \u2013 19.10) and stays fixed when the page is scrolled (the PAN Details page has its own top navigation \u2013 see Sl. No 6.3). It gives the customer access to the credit score fetched from Experian and to the profile (with Logout) from any page.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Left:</b> Shriram Credit logo</li><li><b>Right:</b> Credit Score icon (Sl. No 6.1) and Profile icon (Sl. No 6.2)</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"4\" class=\"dp\">Captured in Sl. No 6.1 and 6.2</td><td rowspan=\"4\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Completed</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"prd-assets/f06-logo.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Shriram Credit logo</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Image (top navigation, left corner)</p><p><b>Action:</b> Display only.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"prd-assets/f05-credit-icon.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Credit Score icon</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Icon (top navigation, right corner)</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, opens the credit score pop up \u2013 see Sl. No 6.1.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"prd-assets/f05-profile-icon.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Profile icon</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Icon (top navigation, right corner)</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, opens the Profiles pop up \u2013 see Sl. No 6.2.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-6.1\"><td rowspan=\"4\" class=\"sl\">6.1</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f05-credit-report.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"4\">User clicking the Credit Score icon in the top navigation to view the credit score</td><td><p>The Credit Score icon is part of the top navigation (Sl. No 6). On click, the system shall open the credit score pop up over the current page, showing the credit score fetched from Experian (Sl. No 3). The customer stays on the same page; closing the pop up returns to it. What the pop up shows when Experian returns no score (no credit history / no record found / Experian call failed) is to be confirmed <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-20\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-20');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-20\">Pending \u00b7 P-20</a></p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Title:</b> \u201cYour credit score as of DD MMM YYYY\u201d \u2013 the date the score was fetched (e.g. 07 Oct 2026)</li><li><b>Score meter:</b> The score on a 300 \u2013 900 meter (e.g. 790), with its category below it (e.g. \u201cVery Good\u201d); \u201c300\u201d and \u201c900\u201d at the ends</li><li><b>Category table:</b> <table class=\"mini\"><tr><th>Category</th><th>Score Range</th></tr><tr><td><i style=\"background:#1E8E3E\"></i>Excellent</td><td><b>826 - 900</b></td></tr><tr><td><i style=\"background:#34C759\"></i>Very Good</td><td><b>776 - 825</b></td></tr><tr><td><i style=\"background:#FFC107\"></i>Good</td><td><b>701 - 775</b></td></tr><tr><td><i style=\"background:#FF8C1A\"></i>Average</td><td><b>601 - 700</b></td></tr><tr><td><i style=\"background:#E02424\"></i>Needs Help</td><td><b>300 - 600</b></td></tr></table></li><li><b>Issue line:</b> \u201cIssue with your Credit Score? Raise an issue\u201d</li><li><b>Footer:</b> \u201cPowered by experian\u201d</li><li><b>Close icon:</b> (X) at the top right</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"4\" class=\"dp\"><b>Credit Score Viewed:</b><ul><li>Yes</li><li>No</li></ul><br><b>Credit Score Viewed Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td rowspan=\"4\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Completed</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"prd-assets/f05-credit-icon.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Credit Score icon</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Icon (top navigation, right corner)</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the system shall open the credit score pop up.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f06-raise-issue.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Raise an issue</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Hyperlink</p><p><b>Action:</b> Shown as \u201cIssue with your Credit Score? Raise an issue\u201d. On click, the system shall open https://www.experian.com/help/dispute-credit/ in a new tab; the pop up stays open.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"prd-assets/f06-close-credit.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> (X) Close icon</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Icon</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the credit score pop up is closed and the customer stays on the same page.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-6.2\"><td rowspan=\"4\" class=\"sl\">6.2</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f05-profile.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"4\">User clicking the Profile icon in the top navigation to view the profile or log out</td><td><p>The Profile icon is part of the top navigation (Sl. No 6). On click, the system shall open the Profiles pop up over the current page, showing the name fetched from the PAN records and the PAN Number, with the Logout CTA.</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Title:</b> \u201cProfiles\u201d</li><li><b>Profile card:</b> Initial letter of the name, the name as per PAN (e.g. AZHAGARSAMY SUBBURAJ) and the PAN Number (e.g. CBOPA8195B), with a tick</li><li><b>CTA:</b> \u201cLogout\u201d with the logout icon</li><li><b>Close icon:</b> (X) at the top right</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"4\" class=\"dp\"><b>Profile Viewed:</b><ul><li>Yes</li><li>No</li></ul><br><b>Profile Viewed Date &amp; Time:</b><br>DD-MMM-YYYY; HH:MM:SS</td><td rowspan=\"4\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Completed</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"prd-assets/f05-profile-icon.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Profile icon</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Icon (top navigation, right corner)</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the system shall open the Profiles pop up.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"prd-assets/f06-logout-cta.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Logout</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> CTA</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the customer is logged out and lands on the Landing page (Sl. No 1).</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"prd-assets/f06-close-profile.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> (X) Close icon</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Icon</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the profile pop up is closed and the customer stays on the same page.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"sl-6.3\"><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"sl\">6.3</td><td class=\"shot\"><img src=\"prd-assets/f06-topnav-pan.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td rowspan=\"3\">Top navigation on the PAN Details page \u2013 logo and Logout</td><td><p>On the PAN Details page (Sl. No 4) only, the top navigation shows the Shriram Credit logo and the Logout icon. The Logout icon is shown directly in the top navigation (not inside the Profiles pop up). The Credit Score and Profile icons are not shown on this page; from Sl. No 5 onwards Logout is available inside the Profiles pop up (Sl. No 6.2).</p><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Screen Content:</b></p><ul class=\"content-list\"><li><b>Left:</b> Shriram Credit logo</li><li><b>Right:</b> Logout icon</li></ul></div></td><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"dp\">No data captured from this navigation</td><td rowspan=\"3\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Completed</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"prd-assets/f06-logo.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Shriram Credit logo</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Image (top navigation, left corner)</p><p><b>Action:</b> Display only.</p></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"shot\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"prd-assets/f06-logout-icon.png\" alt=\"\"></td><td><div class=\"spec\"><p><b>Field Name:</b> Logout</p><p><b>Field Type:</b> Icon (top navigation, right corner)</p><p><b>Action:</b> On click, the customer is logged out and lands on the Landing page (Sl. No 1).</p><p><b>Condition:</b> Shown only on the PAN Details page (Sl. No 4).</p></div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>Integration Requirements<span class=\"info\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"How to read the columns\" onclick=\"event.preventDefault()\">i<span class=\"info-pop\" role=\"tooltip\"><b>How to read the columns</b><table><tr><th>ID</th><td>Reference number, so other parts of the PRD can point to it (e.g. \u201cSubmit OTP triggers INT-001\u201d)</td></tr><tr><th>Integration</th><td>Which external system is called</td></tr><tr><th>Purpose</th><td>Why the journey needs it</td></tr><tr><th>Trigger</th><td>The exact moment or button that makes the call happen</td></tr><tr><th>Input</th><td>Data the LOS sends to that system</td></tr><tr><th>Expected Output</th><td>Data the LOS gets back</td></tr><tr><th>Success Behaviour</th><td>What the customer experiences when the call works</td></tr><tr><th>Failure Behaviour</th><td>What happens if the call fails, times out or returns an error</td></tr></table></span></span></h2><table class=\"int\"><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>Integration</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Trigger</th><th>Input</th><th>Expected Output</th><th>Success Behaviour</th><th>Failure Behaviour</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>INT-001</td><td>Experian</td><td>Retrieve credit information / credit score for evaluating loan offers</td><td>On successful OTP verification (Module 2), after the customer gives the Experian consent</td><td>Customer mobile number</td><td>Credit score / credit information <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-09\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-09');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-09\">Pending \u00b7 P-09</a></td><td>Customer proceeds to PAN Verification without waiting for the response</td><td><a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-07\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-07');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-07\">Pending \u00b7 P-07</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td>INT-002</td><td>OTP Service Provider <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-10\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-10');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-10\">Pending \u00b7 P-10</a></td><td>Send and verify the 6 digit OTP for the MF linked mobile number</td><td>Continue CTA on Module 1; Resend OTP CTA on Module 2</td><td>Mobile number</td><td>OTP sent / verification result</td><td>Customer proceeds to PAN Verification</td><td><a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-02\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-02');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-02\">Pending \u00b7 P-02</a> <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-10\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-10');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-10\">Pending \u00b7 P-10</a></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>Pending Clarifications<span class=\"count wip\">12</span><span class=\"info\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"How to read this list\" onclick=\"event.preventDefault()\">i<span class=\"info-pop\" role=\"tooltip\"><b>How to read this list</b><table><tr><th>ID</th><td>Reference number. Anything not yet decided elsewhere in the PRD carries an amber \u201cPending \u00b7 P-09\u201d badge that jumps to its row here</td></tr><tr><th>Module</th><td>Which part of the journey the question is about (\u201cAll\u201d means the whole journey)</td></tr><tr><th>Clarification Required</th><td>The question that must be answered before that requirement is final. Until then the related item stays TBD and must not be built on assumptions</td></tr><tr><th>When answered</th><td>The answer is written into the PRD and the question moves to Completed Clarifications below</td></tr></table></span></span></h2><table class=\"int\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:70px\">ID</th><th style=\"width:110px\">Module</th><th>Clarification Required</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr id=\"P-24\"><td>P-24</td><td>Modules 8 \u2013 10</td><td>Sl. No 17 \u2013 19.12 (Mutual Fund Selection, Loan Application Summary, KYC Verification) are written from the prototype screens. Please share the UAT screenshots and confirm: (a) when the ongoing application pop up (17.3) is shown; (b) messages for a loan amount or fund amount outside the limits (17.4, 17.5) and for an invalid email (19); (c) email OTP resend timer, attempts and wrong OTP message (19.2); (d) what is shown if the Aadhaar status is not received in time (19.11); (e) the Photo Verification and Bank Details steps (19.12 onwards).</td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-23\"><td>P-23</td><td>Curated Offers</td><td>Sl. No 16 \u2013 16.3 are written from the prototype screens. Please share the UAT screenshots of the Curated Offers page, How is it calculated, the Refresh portfolio pop up and the drop off view, and confirm: (a) when the Refresh pop up is shown automatically, and whether Refresh Portfolio asks for an MF Central OTP before refreshing (the prototype refreshes in place and shows \u201cPortfolio refreshed successfully\u201d, as in the UAT screenshot of 12-10-2026); (b) what Discard does in the drop off view; (c) whether a returning customer always lands on the drop off view; (d) what the KFS document link on the offer card opens; (e) how long each banner ticker message stays before the next one scrolls up (prototype: 3 seconds).</td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-21\"><td>P-21</td><td>Module 4</td><td>Sl. No 7.1 (LOS page) \u2013 what exactly happens on Refresh (MF Central checked again and the redirection pop up shown again, or something else), and can the customer change the mobile number or PAN from here? (The MF Central OTP part of this question is answered \u2013 see P-22.)</td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-20\"><td>P-20</td><td>Top Navigation</td><td>Sl. No 6.1 \u2013 credit score pop up when there is no valid score. Experian scores run from 300 to 900, so a score below 300 is not returned; instead the response can carry no score for (a) a customer with no or too little credit history (new to credit), (b) no record found for the mobile number / PAN, or (c) the Experian call failing or timing out. Please check on UAT (e.g. with a new-to-credit customer) or with the tech team what the live journey does in each case: is the Credit Score icon still shown, what does the pop up show (e.g. \u201cScore not available\u201d, a blank meter, or an error), and does the journey continue as normal?</td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-18\"><td>P-18</td><td>Curated Offers</td><td>Curated Offers page: the 18 to 70 years age limit (from the DOB entered on the PAN Details page) is validated on this page, not on PAN Details, so customers outside the limit are not blocked at PAN verification and can be tracked. Message confirmed by the owner: \u201cApplicant must be between 18 to 70 years of age.\u201d (DISC-139). Still to confirm: where exactly on the Curated Offers page it is shown, and whether Start Application is blocked.</td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-02\"><td>P-02</td><td>Module 1</td><td>Does the Continue CTA call an OTP send API at this point, and what is the failure behaviour?</td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-03\"><td>P-03</td><td>Module 1</td><td>Any backend check on the mobile number at this stage (existing customer, ongoing application, blacklist)?</td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-05\"><td>P-05</td><td>Module 2</td><td>Resend and wrong attempt blocks to be enforced server side against the mobile number (currently held in the prototype browser storage). Confirm reset conditions for the counters.</td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-07\"><td>P-07</td><td>Module 2</td><td>Experian failure / timeout behaviour and the effect of the score on eligibility and offers.</td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-08\"><td>P-08</td><td>All</td><td>Where should the header Shriram Credit logo navigate in the live journey (shriramcredit.in, the LAMF landing page, or nowhere)? The prototype sends it to its own review home page.</td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-09\"><td>P-09</td><td>Module 2</td><td>Experian response (INT-001 Expected Output): what exactly comes back from Experian \u2013 only the credit score (e.g. 750), or the score plus the full credit report (existing loans, EMIs, missed payments, recent loan enquiries)? How should a \u201cNo record found\u201d response be handled for a customer with no credit history? Depends on the Experian service Shriram Credit has signed up for.</td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-10\"><td>P-10</td><td>Module 1 & 2</td><td>OTP service provider (INT-002): which vendor sends and verifies the OTP, and what the customer sees if OTP verification fails or times out (a failure to send is covered in P-02).</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<details class=\"done\"><summary><span class=\"done-title\">Completed Clarifications<span class=\"count ok\">12</span></span><span class=\"info\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"How to read this list\" onclick=\"event.preventDefault()\">i<span class=\"info-pop\" role=\"tooltip\"><b>How to read this list</b><table><tr><th>ID</th><td>Reference number of the question (kept when a pending item is answered)</td></tr><tr><th>Module</th><td>Which part of the journey the question was about</td></tr><tr><th>Clarification Required</th><td>The question that was asked</td></tr><tr><th>Clarification Provided</th><td>The confirmed answer and the date it was given. The modules above already follow it</td></tr></table></span></span><span class=\"chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><table class=\"int\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:70px\">ID</th><th style=\"width:110px\">Module</th><th>Clarification Required</th><th>Clarification Provided</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr id=\"P-22\"><td>P-22</td><td>Module 5</td><td>Sl. No 10 \u2013 MF Central Fetching Your Portfolio screen: the screenshot is shared (DISC-160); please confirm what is shown if the fetch fails or times out, and where the customer goes from there. Also: wrong OTP message and attempts on the MF Central OTP page (was P-21 b).</td><td>The MF Central pages (OTP, Select AMCs, Fetching, Portfolio Discovery Complete) belong to MF Central; the LOS has no access to them. Their behaviour, including failures and wrong OTP handling, is MF Central\u2019s; any functional issue is raised to MF Central by mail (DISC-161).<span class=\"answered\">Answered 09-10-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-19\"><td>P-19</td><td>Module 4</td><td>Sl. No 5 \u2013 LOS to MF Central consent page: the row is written from the prototype screen. Please share the UAT screenshots so the screenshot and field crops can be replaced, and confirm what the Dashboard and Profile icons (top right) do on this page.</td><td>UAT screenshots shared (DISC-142). Credit Score icon opens the credit score pop up (score from Experian, fetched date, category, Raise an issue link to Experian, close); Profile icon opens the Profiles pop up (name as per PAN, PAN Number, Logout to the Landing page, close).<span class=\"answered\">Answered 07-10-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-16\"><td>P-16</td><td>Module 2</td><td>Experian consent checkbox: the UAT screenshots shared on 30-09-2026 (uatlamf.shriramcredit.in) show the Enter OTP pop up without the Experian consent checkbox, and Submit OTP turns yellow as soon as 6 digits are entered. Sl. No 3 describes the checkbox as mandatory. Confirm whether the checkbox is part of the live journey.</td><td>The checkbox is displayed only when the customer verifies the OTP for the first time. A customer who has already verified the OTP earlier sees the Enter OTP pop up without the checkbox, and Submit OTP is enabled once all 6 digits are entered (DISC-129).<span class=\"answered\">Answered 05-10-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-17\"><td>P-17</td><td>Module 3</td><td>PAN Details page: the exact live text for (a) a PAN Number not in the ABCDE1234F format, and (b) the PAN verification failures \u2013 name match below 60%, DOB not matching the PAN records, PAN not available. Also: where does the customer land after Logout?</td><td>Live: one common message \u201cPAN verification failed\u201d for every verification failure (DISC-126). The owner set the required messages (DISC-125): empty fields \u2013 CR-10; PAN with fewer than 10 characters \u2013 \u201cPlease enter your valid PAN Number.\u201d (CR-16); name match below 60% \u2013 \u201cPlease enter your name exactly as on your PAN card.\u201d (CR-13); DOB not matching \u2013 \u201cPlease enter your date of birth exactly as on your PAN card.\u201d (CR-15); PAN not available \u2013 \u201cPlease enter your PAN Number exactly as on your PAN card.\u201d (CR-17). Logout lands on the Landing page (exit page).<span class=\"answered\">Answered 05-10-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-11\"><td>P-11</td><td>Module 2</td><td>OTP length, resend timer duration and number of resends allowed.</td><td>6 digit OTP; 30 second resend timer; 3 resends allowed, after which the number is blocked for 15 minutes. OTP validity: 30 seconds (see P-04).<span class=\"answered\">Answered 23-09-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-12\"><td>P-12</td><td>Module 2</td><td>Wrong OTP handling \u2013 message, maximum attempts and lockout.</td><td>A validation message is shown for a wrong OTP; after 3 wrong attempts the number is blocked for 60 minutes.<span class=\"answered\">Answered 23-09-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-13\"><td>P-13</td><td>Module 2</td><td>Is the Experian consent checkbox mandatory to submit the OTP?</td><td>Yes. Submit OTP is enabled only when the consent is ticked and all 6 digits are entered.<span class=\"answered\">Answered 23-09-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-14\"><td>P-14</td><td>Module 2</td><td>What does the \u201cEdit\u201d link on the OTP screen do?</td><td>Returns to the mobile number screen (02) with the entered number prefilled.<span class=\"answered\">Answered 23-09-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-15\"><td>P-15</td><td>Module 2</td><td>Which screen opens after a successful OTP submission?</td><td>Enter PAN Details (screen 04), after the Experian call is triggered.<span class=\"answered\">Answered 23-09-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-01\"><td>P-01</td><td>Module 1</td><td>Validation message wording: the shared sample PRD carries \u201c*Required\u201d, \u201c*Invalid mobile number\u201d and \u201cError: Invalid phone number\u201d. The messages currently built follow the wording confirmed in discussion on 22-09-2026. Confirm which set is approved.</td><td>Use the new validation wording given by the owner. The PRD row shows the current live messages; the new wording is tracked as <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-01\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-01');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-01\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-01</a> <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-02\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-02');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-02\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-02</a> <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-03\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-03');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-03\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-03</a> <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-04\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-04');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-04\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-04</a>.<span class=\"answered\">Answered 29-09-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-04\"><td>P-04</td><td>Module 2</td><td>OTP validity / expiry period.</td><td>The OTP is valid for 30 seconds. An OTP submitted later shows \u201cInvalid request id\u201d today; the new wording is tracked as <a class=\"todo-ref\" href=\"#CR-09\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('CR-09');if(t){var d=t.closest('details');if(d)d.open=true;t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Defined in the PRD, not yet changed in the live LOS journey \u2013 open CR-09\">To be changed \u00b7 CR-09</a>.<span class=\"answered\">Answered 30-09-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"P-06\"><td>P-06</td><td>Module 3</td><td>PAN Verification screen: field level rules, PAN format validation, name as per PAN matching logic and DOB / age rule.</td><td>Name as per PAN: alphanumeric, up to 150 characters. DOB: typed (DD/MM/YYYY) or picked from the calendar, 01-Jan-1920 to today, age 18 to 70 years. PAN: ABCDE1234F format. Continue validates every field; an empty field shows \u201c*Required\u201d. Name match threshold: 60% (answered later). Exact error texts are still open <a class=\"pend-ref\" href=\"#P-17\" onclick=\"var t=document.getElementById('P-17');if(t){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});t.classList.remove('flash');void t.offsetWidth;t.classList.add('flash')}return false\" title=\"Open pending clarification P-17\">Pending \u00b7 P-17</a>.<span class=\"answered\">Answered 30-09-2026</span></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></details>\n<h2>Pending Changes<span class=\"count impl\">15</span><span class=\"info\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"How to read this list\" onclick=\"event.preventDefault()\">i<span class=\"info-pop\" role=\"tooltip\"><b>How to read this list</b><table><tr><th>ID</th><td>Change reference (CR). Wherever the PRD above carries a blue \u201cTo be changed \u00b7 CR-01\u201d tag, it jumps to its row here</td></tr><tr><th>Module</th><td>Which part of the journey the item belongs to</td></tr><tr><th>Where in the PRD</th><td>The Sl. No and field that defines it</td></tr><tr><th>What has to change</th><td>How the live LOS journey behaves today and what it has to change to, with the date it was raised</td></tr><tr><th>When done</th><td>Once the owner confirms the change is live, it moves to Completed Changes below and its tags turn green</td></tr></table></span></span></h2><table class=\"int\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:70px\">ID</th><th style=\"width:110px\">Module</th><th style=\"width:220px\">Where in the PRD</th><th>What has to change</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr id=\"CR-01\"><td>CR-01</td><td>Module 1</td><td>Sl. No 2 \u2013 Mobile Number field (Continue CTA with no mobile number)</td><td><div class=\"chg\"><div><b>Current:</b> \u201c*Required\u201d</div><div><b>To be changed as:</b> \u201cPlease enter your MF linked mobile number.\u201d \u2013 displayed when the user clicks the Continue CTA without entering the mobile number</div></div><span class=\"raised\">Raised 30-09-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"CR-02\"><td>CR-02</td><td>Module 1</td><td>Sl. No 2 \u2013 Mobile Number field (less than 10 digits)</td><td><div class=\"chg\"><div><b>Current:</b> \u201c*Invalid mobile number\u201d</div><div><b>To be changed as:</b> \u201cMobile number must be 10 digits.\u201d \u2013 displayed when the user clicks the Continue CTA with less than 10 digits, and on exit from the field</div></div><span class=\"raised\">Raised 30-09-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"CR-03\"><td>CR-03</td><td>Module 1</td><td>Sl. No 2 \u2013 Mobile Number field (first digit 0 to 5)</td><td><div class=\"chg\"><div><b>Current:</b> \u201cError: Invalid phone number\u201d \u2013 displayed only when the user clicks the Continue CTA</div><div><b>To be changed as:</b> \u201cMobile number cannot start with 0, 1, 2, 3, 4 or 5. Please enter a valid mobile number.\u201d \u2013 displayed as soon as the customer attempts a first digit of 0 to 5</div></div><span class=\"raised\">Raised 30-09-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"CR-04\"><td>CR-04</td><td>Module 1</td><td>Sl. No 2 \u2013 Mobile Number field (non numeric character)</td><td><div class=\"chg\"><div><b>Current:</b> No validation \u2013 the character simply cannot be entered</div><div><b>To be changed as:</b> The character still cannot be entered, and \u201cOnly numbers are allowed. Letters, spaces and special characters cannot be entered.\u201d is displayed when the customer attempts a non numeric character</div></div><span class=\"raised\">Raised 30-09-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"CR-05\"><td>CR-05</td><td>Module 2</td><td>Sl. No 3 \u2013 Enter OTP field (non numeric character)</td><td><div class=\"chg\"><div><b>Current:</b> No validation \u2013 the character simply cannot be entered</div><div><b>To be changed as:</b> The character still cannot be entered, and \u201cOnly numbers are allowed. Letters, spaces and special characters cannot be entered.\u201d is displayed when the customer attempts a non numeric character</div></div><span class=\"raised\">Raised 30-09-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"CR-06\"><td>CR-06</td><td>Module 2</td><td>Sl. No 3 \u2013 Enter OTP field (wrong OTP, 1st to 3rd back to back attempt)</td><td><div class=\"chg\"><div><b>Current:</b> \u201cInvalid OTP\u201d on the 1st, 2nd and 3rd back to back wrong attempt</div><div><b>To be changed as:</b> \u201cThe OTP you entered is incorrect. Please try again. You have 2 attempts left.\u201d (1st wrong attempt) / \u201cThe OTP you entered is incorrect. Please try again. You have 1 attempt left.\u201d (2nd) / \u201cThe OTP you entered is incorrect. You have no attempts left.\u201d (3rd). The block message on the next attempt stays as it is today</div></div><span class=\"raised\">Raised 30-09-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"CR-09\"><td>CR-09</td><td>Module 2</td><td>Sl. No 3 \u2013 Enter OTP field (OTP submitted after 30 seconds)</td><td><div class=\"chg\"><div><b>Current:</b> \u201cInvalid request id\u201d</div><div><b>To be changed as:</b> \u201cYour OTP has expired. Please click Resend OTP to get a new OTP.\u201d \u2013 displayed when the customer submits the OTP more than 30 seconds after it was sent</div></div><span class=\"raised\">Raised 30-09-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"CR-10\"><td>CR-10</td><td>Module 3</td><td>Sl. No 4 \u2013 Name as per PAN, DOB and PAN Number (field left empty)</td><td><div class=\"chg\"><div><b>Current:</b> \u201c*Required\u201d for every empty field</div><div><b>To be changed as:</b> A message that names the field: \u201cPlease enter your name as per PAN.\u201d / \u201cPlease enter your date of birth as per PAN.\u201d / \u201cPlease enter your PAN Number.\u201d</div></div><span class=\"raised\">Raised 30-09-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"CR-11\"><td>CR-11</td><td>Module 3</td><td>Sl. No 4 \u2013 PAN Number field (message for a character that does not fit its position)</td><td><div class=\"chg\"><div><b>Current:</b> Message shown next to the PAN Number label as the PAN is typed:<ul><li>\u201c1st character must be a letter\u201d</li><li>\u201c2nd character must be a letter\u201d</li><li>\u201c3rd character must be a letter\u201d</li><li>\u201c4th character must be a letter\u201d</li><li>\u201c5th character must be a letter\u201d</li><li>\u201c6th character must be a number\u201d</li><li>\u201c7th character must be a number\u201d</li><li>\u201c8th character must be a number\u201d</li><li>\u201c9th character must be a letter\u201d</li><li>\u201c10th character must be a letter\u201d</li></ul></div><div><b>To be changed as:</b> Message for each position:<ul><li>\u201c1st character must be a letter (A\u2013Z).\u201d</li><li>\u201c2nd character must be a letter (A\u2013Z).\u201d</li><li>\u201c3rd character must be a letter (A\u2013Z).\u201d</li><li>\u201cThe 4th character must be (P) \u2013 only individual PAN is allowed.\u201d \u2013 see CR-18</li><li>\u201c5th character must be a letter (A\u2013Z).\u201d</li><li>\u201c6th character must be a number (0\u20139).\u201d</li><li>\u201c7th character must be a number (0\u20139).\u201d</li><li>\u201c8th character must be a number (0\u20139).\u201d</li><li>\u201c9th character must be a number (0\u20139).\u201d</li><li>\u201c10th character must be a letter (A\u2013Z).\u201d</li></ul></div></div><span class=\"raised\">Raised 01-10-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"CR-12\"><td>CR-12</td><td>Module 3</td><td>Sl. No 4 \u2013 DOB field (typed date before 01-Jan-1920 or after today)</td><td><div class=\"chg\"><div><b>Current:</b> \u201c*Invalid date\u201d next to the DOB label</div><div><b>To be changed as:</b> \u201cPlease enter your date of birth exactly as on your PAN card.\u201d (owner\u2019s wording, DISC-134)</div></div><span class=\"raised\">Raised 01-10-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"CR-13\"><td>CR-13</td><td>Module 3</td><td>Sl. No 4 \u2013 Name as per PAN (name verification failure, name match below 60%)</td><td><div class=\"chg\"><div><b>Current:</b> One common message \u201cPAN verification failed\u201d for every verification failure \u2013 it does not say whether the name, DOB or PAN Number failed (DISC-126)</div><div><b>To be changed as:</b> Shown on this PAN Details page, next to the Name as per PAN label, only when the name check fails: \u201cPlease enter your name exactly as on your PAN card.\u201d The match percentage (60%) is never shown to the customer (DISC-117, DISC-125)</div></div><span class=\"raised\">Raised 01-10-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"CR-15\"><td>CR-15</td><td>Module 3</td><td>Sl. No 4 \u2013 DOB (DOB does not match the PAN records)</td><td><div class=\"chg\"><div><b>Current:</b> One common message \u201cPAN verification failed\u201d for every verification failure \u2013 it does not say whether the name, DOB or PAN Number failed (DISC-126)</div><div><b>To be changed as:</b> Shown on this PAN Details page, next to the DOB label, only when the DOB check fails: \u201cPlease enter your date of birth exactly as on your PAN card.\u201d</div></div><span class=\"raised\">Raised 05-10-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"CR-16\"><td>CR-16</td><td>Module 3</td><td>Sl. No 4 \u2013 PAN Number (fewer than 10 characters entered)</td><td><div class=\"chg\"><div><b>Current:</b> Live message not captured \u2013 the owner set the required wording (DISC-125)</div><div><b>To be changed as:</b> Message next to the PAN Number label when Continue is clicked: \u201cPlease enter your valid PAN Number.\u201d</div></div><span class=\"raised\">Raised 05-10-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"CR-17\"><td>CR-17</td><td>Module 3</td><td>Sl. No 4 \u2013 PAN Number (PAN not available in the PAN records)</td><td><div class=\"chg\"><div><b>Current:</b> One common message \u201cPAN verification failed\u201d for every verification failure \u2013 it does not say whether the name, DOB or PAN Number failed (DISC-126)</div><div><b>To be changed as:</b> Shown on this PAN Details page, next to the PAN Number label, only when the PAN is not available: \u201cPlease enter your PAN Number exactly as on your PAN card.\u201d</div></div><span class=\"raised\">Raised 05-10-2026</span></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"CR-18\"><td>CR-18</td><td>Module 3</td><td>Sl. No 4 \u2013 PAN Number (4th character \u2013 individual PAN only)</td><td><div class=\"chg\"><div><b>Current:</b> Any letter is accepted in the 4th place (e.g. CBOCA8195B can be entered); a non-letter shows \u201c4th character must be a letter\u201d</div><div><b>To be changed as:</b> Only P is accepted in the 4th place (individual PAN only). Any other character is not entered and \u201cThe 4th character must be (P) \u2013 only individual PAN is allowed.\u201d is shown at once next to the PAN Number label, so a non-individual PAN is stopped in the PAN Number field itself (DISC-137)</div></div><span class=\"raised\">Raised 06-10-2026</span></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<details class=\"done\"><summary><span class=\"done-title\">Completed Changes<span class=\"count ok\">1</span></span><span class=\"info\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"How to read this list\" onclick=\"event.preventDefault()\">i<span class=\"info-pop\" role=\"tooltip\"><b>How to read this list</b><table><tr><th>ID</th><td>Change reference (kept when it moves from Pending Changes)</td></tr><tr><th>Module</th><td>Which part of the journey the item belongs to</td></tr><tr><th>Where in the PRD</th><td>The Sl. No and field that defines it</td></tr><tr><th>What was changed</th><td>What is now live in the LOS journey, and the date the owner confirmed it</td></tr></table></span></span><span class=\"chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><table class=\"int\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:70px\">ID</th><th style=\"width:110px\">Module</th><th style=\"width:220px\">Where in the PRD</th><th>What was changed</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr id=\"CR-14\"><td>CR-14</td><td>Module 3</td><td>Sl. No 4 \u2013 Name as per PAN (characters allowed)</td><td>Alphabets (A\u2013Z) and space only. Numbers and special characters cannot be entered; what is typed is captured in CAPITAL letters. Confirmed live by the owner (DISC-128)<span class=\"answered\">Changed 05-10-2026</span></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></details>\n</main>";
